<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Luuqaasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luuqa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luuqaasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luuqaasi Xaafida Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luuqaasi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Luuqaasi Yesuusi doorida tammanne nam77u hawaareta giddon deenna. Luuqaasa Wonggelay, Yesuusi koyro nabeta doonan yaana geetettidi odettidayssa, Isra7eeleti kaseppe naagishe de7ida “Kiristtoosa” gideyssanne asa zerethi ubbaa ashsheyssa gideyssa qonccisees. Luuqaasi, ba maaxafan Yesuusi, “Manqotas Wonggelaa sabbakanaw” ba aawappe kiitettidayssa gideyssanne he Wonggelay asaas de7iya dumma dumma metuwappe kesseyssa gideyssa odees. Luuqaasa Wonggelaa giddon, Yesuusa yuussabaa odiya koyro shemppotaninne Yesuusi pude salo keyidayssa odiya wurssetha shemppotan qonccidi odettiday ufayssabaa. Yesuusi salo keyidaappe guye ammanoy waanidi diccidaakkonne dalggidaakko odiya taarikiya ha Wonggelaa xaafey hawaareta ooso maxaafan xaafis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiitanchchota mazmuriyabaa, Yesuusi yelettida wode henthachchoti bidi be7idayssa odiya taarikey, Yesuusi na7atethan Xoossa Keethi bidayssa, qadhettiya Samaare addiyabaanne dhayidi benttida na7abaa odiya taarikey, Luuqaasa Wonggelaa xalaalan benttiya taarike. Luuqaasa Wonggelan gaxappe gaxa gakkanaw de7iya waanna qofati woosabaa, Geeshsha Ayyaanabaa, Yesuusa oosuwa giddon maccasatas de7iya bessaanne Xoossay nagara maareyssa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Luuqaasa Wonggelaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiya Yohaannisanne Yesuusa yeletethaa 1:5-2:52</para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa oosuwa 3:1-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa xinqqatiyanne paacetethaa 3:21-4:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi Galiilan oothida oosuwa 4:14-9:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Galiilappe Yerusalaame gakkanaw 9:51-19:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetha saamintta Yerusalaame heeran 19:28-23:56</para>
  <para style="io1">Hayqoppe denddo, qonccethaanne salo kessaa 24:1-53</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bonchcho Tewofiloosa, nu giddon polettidabas daroti, banttaw dandda7ettida mela xaafidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He taarikiya entti xaafiday koyroppe doomidi ayfe markkatinne qaala haggaazeyssati nuus odidayssa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Takka ta baggara koyroppe akeeka xeellidaappe guye, he taarikiya hanotaa maarayada new xaafoy taw lo77o gidi benttis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessika, ne tamaaridabay tuma gideyssa erisanaassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa yeletethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yihuda kawuwa Heroodisa wode Abbaya yaraappe gidida Zakkariyaasa giya Ayhude kahiney de7ees. Iya machchiyaka Aarona sheeshaappe. I sunthaykka Elsabeexo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1Taari 24:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nam77ayka Godaa woganne kiita ubbaa naagidi borey baynna Xoossaa sinthan xillotethan de7idosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hanoppe attin Elsabeexa maynthi gidida gisho enttaw na7i baawa. Nam77ayka qassi cimidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Issi gallas Zakkariyaasi ba gishuwa maaran Xoossaa sinthan kahinetethan haggaazees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kahinetetha wogan Xoossa Keethi gelidi ixaane cuyisanaw iya saami gakkis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ixaaney cuya wode asay karen woossees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Godaa kiitanchchoy yarshshuwa yarshshiya bessaafe ushachcha baggara eqqidi benttis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zakkariyaasi iya be7ida wode dagammidi daro yayyis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin kiitanchchoy iyaakko, “Zakkariyaasa yayyofa; ne woosay si7ettis. Ne machchiya Elsabeexa adde na7a yelana, iya Yohaannisa gada ne sunthana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I new injjenne ufayssi gidana; daroti iya yeletethan ufayttana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Godaa sinthan I gita gidana woyne ushshaa gidin hara mathoya ushshaa uyenna. Ba aaye ulon de7ishe Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Tay 6:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Isra7eele asatappe darota bantta Godaa, Xoossaakko zaarana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Aawata wozana naytakko zaarana, kiitettonayssata xillota cinccatethaako zaarana mela, Godaas bessiya dere giigisanaw Eliyaasa ayyaananinne wolqqan Godaa sinthan baana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mil 4:5-6</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Zakkariyaasi kiitanchchuwako, “Ta hessa aybin eranee? Taaranne ta machcheera cimida” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy zaaridi, “Taani Xoossaa sinthan eqqiya Gabreele. Ha mishirachchuwa new odanaw Xoossaafe kiitetas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Daane 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hekko, wodiya naagidi polettiya ta qaala ne ammanonna ixxida gisho, hayssi polettana gakkanaw neeni muume gidana, odettanawukka dandda7akka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode Zakkariyaasi Xoossa Keethi gelidi gam77ida gisho, aybi hanide gidi asay karen naagishe gam77is. <verse number="22" style="v"/>I kare keyidi enttana odisanaw dandda7ibeenna. Malli besoppe attin odettanaw dandda7onayssa be7ida wode qonccethi be7idayssa eridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Zakkariyaasi ba haggazuwa polidi soo simmis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, iya machchiya Elsabeexa qanthatasu. Ichchashu ageena kumethi bana geenthada gam77asu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iya, “Goday ba maarotan ta boriya asaa giddofe digganaw be7idi ha wodiyan hayssa oothis” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa yeletethay koyrottidi odettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Elsabeexa qanthatin usuppuntha ageenan, Xoossay kiitanchchuwa Gabreele Galiila biittan de7iya Naazirete katamaa kiittis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kawuwa Dawite sheeshaappe gidida Yoosefa giya uraas oyshettida geela7eekko kiittis. He geela7iya Mayraamo geetettawusu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Maato 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy iikko bidi, “Daro dosettidare, saroy new gido, Xoossay neera de7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mayraama iya odan daro dagammada, “Hayssi aybi sarotho” gada heetasu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy zaaridi, “Mayraame babbofa; neeni Xoossaa sinthan saba demmadasa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hekko neeni qanthatana adde na7a yelana, iya sunthaaka Yesuusa gada sunthana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Maato 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>I gita gidana, Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa na7aa geetetti xeegettana. Godaa Xoossay iya aawa Dawite araata iyaw immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Saamu 7:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v"/>I Yayqooba sheeshaa bolla merinaw kawotana; iya kawotethaas zawi baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mayraama kiitanchchuwako, “Hessi waanidi hananee? Ta adde erikke” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy zaaridi, “Geeshsha Ayyaanay ne bolla wodhdhana, Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa wolqqay ne bolla kuyattana. Hessa gisho, yelettiya geeshsha na7ay Xoossaa Na7aa geetettana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hekko, ne dabbiya Elsabeexa ba cimatetha laythan adde na7a qanthatasu. Iya maynthi geetettidaaro, shin ha77i usuppuntha ageena oykkasu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Xoossaa xooniyabay baawa”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Medhe 18:14</ref></char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mayraama, “Hekko, taani Godaa aylliw, ne qaalada taw hano” yaagasu. Hessafe guye, kiitanchchoy iippe shaakettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mayraama he saaminttan denddada Yihuda biittan de7iya issi geze katama basu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Zakkariyaasa soo gelada Elsabeexo sarothasu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Elsabeexa Mayraami sarothuwa si7ida wode I uluwan de7iya na7ay ufayssan guppis. Elsabeexa Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumada, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ba qaala dhoqqu oothada, “Neeni maccasaa giddofe anjjettidaaro, ne qanthatida na7aykka anjjettidayssa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hanoshin, ta Godaa aaye, neeni taakko yaana mela taani oonee? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hekko ne sarothuwa ta si7ida wode ta uluwan de7iya na7ay ufayssan guppis. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Goday polana gidi immida qaala ammanidaara, iya anjjettidaaro” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mayraami mazmuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mayraama hayssada yaagasu:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ta shemppiya Godaa bonchchawusu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Saamu 2:1-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>ta Ayyaanay dhaliya Xoossan ufayttees.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>I ba aylle kawushshatethaa be7is.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hachchife doomidi yeletethi ubbay tana anjjettidaaro gaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1Saamu 1:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ays giikko, wolqqaama gidida I, taw gitabaa oothis.</para>
  <para style="q1">Iya sunthay Geeshshaa.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Iya bonchcheyssata bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2">iya maarotethay merinaappe merinaa gakkanaassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ba qesiyan minobaa oothis,</para>
  <para style="q2">bantta wozanan otortteyssata laallis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wolqqaama kawota araataappe kawushshis;</para>
  <para style="q2">banttana kawushshidayssata kabboys.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Iyo 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Koshattidayssata lo77oban kalssis,</para>
  <para style="q2">shin dureta mela kushe yeddis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ba maarota qoppidi,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ba aylliya Isra7eele maaddis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hessika nu aawatas odida qaalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2">Abrahamesinne iya sheeshas gidayssa merinaw polanaassa”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Saamu 2:1-10</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Medhe 17:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mayraama Elsabeexi matan heedzu ageena mela gam77ada ba soo simmasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa yeletethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Elsabeexis yelo qammay gakkin adde na7a yelasu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>I shoorotinne I dabboti Goday gita maarota oothidayssa si7idi, iira issife ufayttidosona. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hosppuntha gallasan yooga na7a qaxxaranaw yidosona. Iya aawa sunthan Zakkariyaasa gidi sunthanaw koyidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="60" style="v"/>Shin aayiya, “Akkay, Yohaannisa geetettanaw bessees” yaagasu. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Enttika, “Ne dabbotappe ha sunthan xeegettiday oonikka baawa” yaagidosona. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Iya aaway oona gidi sunthaneekko eranaw koyidi iya malla oychchidosona. <verse number="63" style="v"/>I xaafiyabaa oychchi ekkidi, “Iya sunthay Yohaannisa” gidi xaafis. Ubbay I xaafidayssa be7idi malaalettidosona. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Iira Zakkariyaasa inxarssay bilettis, Xoossaa galatishe odetethi oykkis. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Shooroti ubbay yashshan kumidosona. Ha hanidabay geze Yihuda biittan odettis. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Hessa si7ida ubbay, “Ha na7ay ay hananddeshsha” gidi bantta giddon odettidosona. Godaa kushey iyara de7ees.</para>
  <para style="s">Zakkariyaasa mazmuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yohaannisa aaway Zakkariyaasi Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi hayssada yaagidi tinbbite odis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Isra7eeliya Goday galatetto,</para>
  <para style="q2">yidi ba asaa wozis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Ba aylliya Dawite keethan</para>
  <para style="q2">atotethaa kaciya denthis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Hessika beni wode geeshsha nabeta doonan odettidayssa mela,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Iya ashoy nu morkketappenne</para>
  <para style="q2">nuura eqettiya ubbaa kushiyappe.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Hessa I oothiday nu aawatas ba maarota bessanaasinne,</para>
  <para style="q2">ba geeshsha caaquwa naaganaassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Nu aawa Abrahames caaqqida</para>
  <para style="q2">caaquwa qoppanasinne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>nu morkketa kusheppe kessidi</para>
  <para style="q2">yashshi baynna iya haggaazana melassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>Nu laytha ubban geeshshatethaninne xillotethan</para>
  <para style="q2">ba sinthan nuna essanaassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Qassi laa na7aw, neeni Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa nabe geetettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Godaa ogiya loythanaw ne iya sinthan baana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>Entta nagaray qushettin,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti atotethi demmanayssa ne Godaa deriyas odana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Nu Xoossaa lo77o maarotethaafe denddoyssan</para>
  <para style="q2">wontta xalqey nuus saluwappe keyis.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>Hessika dhumaninne,</para>
  <para style="q2">hayqo kuya garssan de7eyssatas poo7isanaassa,</para>
  <para style="q2">nu tohuwakka saro ogiyakko zaaranaassa”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Na7ay diccis, Ayyaanan minnis, Isra7eele asaas qonccana gakkanaw bazzo biittan de7is.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa yeletethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Maato 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Roome biittan de7iya asay ubbay taybettana melanne sunthay xaafettana mela kawoy Awugisxoosi kiittis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessika Qerenoosi Soore biittaa aysiya wode oosettida koyro taybuwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, issi issi asi ba sunthaa xaafettanaw ba yelettida biittaa bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yoosefikka Dawite keethaafenne yaraappe gidida gisho, Galiila Naazirete katamaappe denddidi Dawite katama gidida Yihuda Beeteleme bis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bishe, yelanaw wodey wurida I oychchi wothida, Mayraamira wolla xaafettanaw bis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti yan de7ishin iw yelo wodey gakkis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ba bayra na7aa yelasu. Curqqara xaaxada imathi aqiyason bessi dhayida gisho daran mehe muziya gonggen zin77isasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Henthanchchotanne kiitanchchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>He gadiyan qamma dorssa wudiya naagishe karen aqiya henthanchchoti de7oosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Godaa kiitanchchoy hassayonna yidi entta matan eqqis. Godaa bonchchoy entta yuushuwan poo7is; enttika wolqqaama yashshi yayyidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin kiitanchchoy, “Yayyofite hekko asaa ubbaas gidiya gita ufayssaa mishirachchuwa ekkada yas. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessika, Dawite kataman ashsheyssi hinttew hachchi yelettis. I Godaa Kiristtoosa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zoqale na7ay curqqara xaaxettidi gonggen zin77idayssa hintte demmana; hessika hinttew malla gido” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qopponna daro salo kiitanchchoti kiitanchchuwura issife qonccidi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Bonchchoy Xoossaas dhoqqa saluwan,</para>
  <para style="q2">saroy biitta bolla Xoossay dosiya asaas gido”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi galatidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoti enttafe shaakettidi saluwa keyidaappe guye henthanchchoti, “Ane Goday nuus qonccisidabaanne hanidabaa be7anaw Beeteleme boos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Enttika ellesidi bidosona. Mayraamo, Yoosefanne zoqale na7aa gonggen zin77idayssa be7idosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Be7i simmidi na7abaa enttaw odettoyssa, qonccisidi he bessan de7iya asaas markkattidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa si7ida ubbay henthanchchoti odidayssan malaalettidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mayraama hanidabaa ubbaa ba wozanan qoppashe de7asu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Henthanchchoti enttaw odettidayssada hanin be7idosona. Hessa gisho, bantta si7idabaasinne be7idaba ubbaas Xoossaa bonchchishenne galatishe simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa Xoossa Keethi efidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hosppuntha qamman, qaxxaro wodey gakkin, I qanthatanaappe sinthe kiitanchchoy wothida sunthan Yesuusa geetettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luuqa 1:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Muse woga mela entta geeshshatetha wodey polettidaappe guye Yoosefaranne Mayraamira yooga na7aa bantta Godaas immanaw Yerusalaame bidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:2-4">Leewe 12:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessika, Godaa wogan, “Adde gidida bayra na7i ubbay Godaas dummattidayssa gido” geetettidi xaafettidayssa polanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kessa 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassi Godaa wogan, nam77u kuraachcho woykko holle yarshshanaw efidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>He wode geeshshinne ammanora mino gidida Simoona geetettiya asi Yerusalaamen de7ees. I Isra7eeleta atotethaa naagishe de7ees. Geeshsha Ayyaanaykka iya bolla de7ees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qassi Kiristtoosa be7onna hayqqonnayssa Geeshsha Ayyaanay iyaw qonccisin eridi de7ees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>I he gallas Ayyaanay kaalethin Xoossa Keethi bis. Na7aa aayeranne aawara wogaa polanaw yooga na7aa Yesuusa ekkidi gelida wode, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Simooni mokki ekkidi na7aa idimmidi,</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 9 fig*</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Godaw ne taw gelida qaala mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">ha77i ne aylliya saron moyza.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta ayfey asaa ubbaa sinthan ne giigisida,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ne ashuwa be7is.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessika kawotethata ubbaas,</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossaa ogiya qonccisiya poo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2">ne asaa Isra7eeleskka bonchcho”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi Xoossaa galatis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yoosefaranne Mayraamira iyaw odettidaban malaalettidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Simooni entta anjjis. Aaye Mayraamikko, “Hekko daro asaa wozanaa qofay qonccana mela, Isra7eelen de7iya darotas entta kunddethaasinne dendduwas Xoossan doorettis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Qassi eqetteyssatas malla gidana. Ne shemppuwarakka qassi mashshi aadhdhana” yaagis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qassi Aseere yaraappe gidida Faanu7ela na7iya Haanna geetettiya nabey de7awusu. Iyakka daro cimasu. Iya ba koyro azinaara laappun laythi de7asu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>I azinay hayqqin hosppun tammanne oyddu laythi gidana gakkanaw qammanne gallas pacey baynna woosaninne xooman Xoossa Keethan haggaazasu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iya he saatiyan bada Xoossaa galatasu; Yerusalaame wozetethaa naagiya ubbaas yooga na7abaa markkattasu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yoosefaranne Mayraamira Godaa higgiyan kiitettida woga ubbaa polidaappe guye Galiila biittan de7iya bantta katama Naazirete simmidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Maato 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>Na7ay diccishenne minnishe bis. Cinccatethan kumis; Xoossaa aadho keehatethay iya bolla de7ees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yoosefaranne Mayraamira Faasikka Baale bonchchanaw laythan laythan Yerusalaame boosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kessa 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Zaare 16:1-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesuusas tammanne nam77u laythi gidiya wode kase meezetidayssada baaliya bonchchanaw bidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Baaliya bonchchidaappe guye soo simmiya wode na7ay Yesuusi Yerusalaamen attis. Shin Yoosefaranne Mayraamira I Yerusalaamen attoyssa eribookkona. <verse number="44" style="v"/>I soo simmiya asaara wolla de7iya daanin entti issi gallasa oge bidosona. I baynnayssa eridaappe guye bantta dabbotanne laggeta matan koyidosona. <verse number="45" style="v"/>I yan dhayin koyishe guye Yerusalaame gakkanaw bidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Heedzu gallasappe guye Xoossa Keethan asttamaareta giddon uttidi enttabaa si7ishenne entta oychchishe de7ishin demmidosona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iya si7iya ubbay iya akeekaninne zaaruwan malaalettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Soo asay iya demmida wode malaalettidosona. Iya aayiyakka, “Ta na7aw, ays nuna hayssada oothadii? Ne aawaranne taara nena koyishe un77ettida” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Tana ays koyeetii? Ta, ta aawa keethan daanaw besseyssa erekketii” yaagis. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Shin I enttako gidabaa entti akeekibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, enttara issife Naazirete katama bis. Enttaw kiitettishe de7is. Iya aayiya he ubbaa ba wozanan wothada naagasu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesuusi, cinccatethan, geesaninne teematethan Xoossaa sinthaninne asa sinthan diccis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Saamu 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Leemi 3:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa timirttiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maato 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kawoy Xibaaryoosi Roome biittan kawotin, tammanne ichchashantho laythan, Phenxe Philaaxoosi Yihuda haariya wode, Heroodisi Galiila haariya wode, iya ishaa Filiphphoosi Ixuuriyasanne Xirakkonddosa haariya wode, Lisaniyoosi Ablaanisa haariya wode, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hannaranne Qayyafara kahine halaqa gidi de7ishin, Xoossaa qaalay Zakkariyaasa na7aa Yohaannisakko bazzo biittaa yis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yohaannisi, “Hintte nagaraappe simmitenne xammaqetite. Xoossay hintte nagaraa atto gaana” yaagidi tamaarssishe Yorddaanose Shaafaa heeran de7iya biitta ubbaa bis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessika nabey Isayaasi ba maxaafan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“Bazzo giddon ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q2">waassiya uraa qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Godaa ogiya giigisite,</para>
  <para style="q2">horogaakka piddi oothite.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aafo ubbay kumana,</para>
  <para style="q2">zumaynne dereynne ziqqi gaana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Wobbe ogey luulana,</para>
  <para style="q2">giigonna horogay qinxi gaana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asho ma77ida ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossaa ashuwa be7ana’ ”</para>
  <para style="m">gidi xaafidayssada hanis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohaannisi, ba kushen xammaqettanaw yida asaakko, “Hinttenoo, shoosha nayto yaanaw de7iya hanquwafe attana mela hinttena zoriday oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte simuwa qonccisiya lo77o ooso oothite, hintte wozanan, ‘Nuus, nu aaway Abrahamey de7ees gidi ceeqettofite.’ Haa si7ite, ha shuchchatappe Xoossay Abrahames na7a kessanaw dandda7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoha 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hekko, beexey mithaa xaphon de7ees. Hiza, lo77o ayfe ayfonna mitha ubbay qanxettidi taman yegettana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Maato 7:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Asay, “Yaatin nuuni ay oothinoo?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yohaannisi zaaridi, “Nam77u afili de7iya asi baynnayssas immo. Kathi de7eyssi baynnayssas immo” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qaraxa qanxiseyssati xammaqettanaw yidi, “Asttamaariyaw, nuuni ay oothinoo?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luuqa 7:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Hintte qanxisanaw kiitettoyssafe aathidi ekkofite” yaagis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qassi wotaaddareti yidi, “Nuuni ay oothinoo” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yohaannisi, “Oodebaakka wolqqan dafidi ekkofite, oonakka worddon mootoppite, hintte damoozey hinttew gido; ufayttidi de7ite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Asay Kiristtoosa naagishe de7iya gisho, Yohaannisa, “I Kiristtoosa gidanddeshshaa?” gidi qoppidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yohaannisi ubbaas zaaridi, “Taani hinttena haathan xammaqays, shin taappe aadhdhidi wolqqaameyssi yaana. Taani iya caammaa wodoruwa billanaw bessonna asi. I hinttena Geeshsha Ayyaananinne taman xammaqana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wudumman de7iya kathaa polo geeshshanaw pithey iya kushen de7ees. Geeshsha kathaa ba shaaliyan qolana; kaliya dhayonna taman xuuggana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qassi Yohaannisi asaa daro zore zoridi Wonggelaa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wonggelaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonan Wonggelaa giya qaalay daro ufayssiya oda woykko mishiraachcho guussu. He mishirachchoyka Kiristtoosi asa zerethi ubbaa merinaa pirddaafe ashshanaw kiitettidi yida gita ufayssaa (Luuqa 1:19; 2:10).</char></note> odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Yohaannisi Heroodisi ba ishaa machchiw, Herodiyada, ekkida gishonne haraa iita oosota gisho kaccida wode,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Maato 14:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mar 6:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Heroodisi kaseyssa bolla haraba ubbaa gujjidi Yohaannisa woyne gelssis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa xammaqetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Maato 1:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yohaannisi qashettanaappe sinthe asaa ubbaa xammaqidi simmin, Yesuusikka qassi xammaqettis. I woossishin saloy dooyettis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay holleda benttishe iya bolla uttis. Saloppe “Taani dosiya na7ay nena; ne tana ufayssaasa yaagiya” qaalay yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medhe 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luuqa 9:35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi tamaarsso oykkiya wode iyaw hasttamu laythi gidishin, asay iya Yoosefa na7a gidi qoppis.</para>
  <para style="q1">Yoosefi Eele na7a, <verse number="24" style="v"/>Eeley Maate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Maatey Leewe na7a, Leewey Milkka na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Milkkey Yoona na7a, Yooni Yoosefa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yoosefi Mataate na7a, Mataatey Amoxe na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Amoxey Nahoome na7a, Nahoomey Asiliime na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Asiliimey Naage na7a, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Naagey Ma7aate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ma7aatey Mataatiye na7a, Mataatiyey Samaye na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Samayey Yihuda na7a, Yihudi Yoonane na7a, Yoonaney Rese na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Resey Zerubaabela na7a, Zerubaabeley Salatiyale na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Salatiyaley Neere na7a, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neerey Melkka na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Milkkey Haade na7a, Haadey Qoosame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Qoosamey Elmodaane na7a, Elmodaaney Eere na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eerey Yoose7e na7a, Yoose7ey Alaazara na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Alaazari Yoorame na7a, Yooramey Maxaate na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Maxaatey Leewe na7a, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Leewey Simoona na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Simooni Yihuda na7a, Yihudi Yoosefa na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Yoosefi Yoonane na7a, Yoonaney Eliyaaqeme na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eliyaaqemey Meliyye na7a, Meliyyey Maynaane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Maynaaney Maxaate na7a, Maxaatey Naatane na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Naataney Dawite na7a, <verse number="32" style="v"/>Dawitey Isseyye na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Isseyyey Iyobeede na7a, Iyobeedey Boo7eze na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Boo7ezi Solomone na7a, Solomoney Na7asoone na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na7asooney Aminaadabe na7a, Aminaadabey Raame na7a, Raamey Arnne na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Arnney Asroome na7a, <verse number="34" style="v"/>Asroomey Faarese na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Faaresey Yihuda na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Yihudi Yayqooba na7a,</para>
  <para style="q">Yayqoobi Yisaaqa na7a, Yisaaqi Abrahaame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Abrahamey Taara na7a, <verse number="35" style="v"/>Taari Naakkore na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Naakkorey Saruuge na7a, Saruugey Rehu na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Rehuy Faaleqe na7a, Faaleqey Ebeero na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ebeeroy Seela na7a, <verse number="36" style="v"/>Seeli Qaynaame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Qaynaamey Arfaksaade na7a, Arfaksaadey Seeme na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Seemey Nohe na7a, Nohey Laamehe na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Laamehey Matusaala na7a, Matusaali Heenoke na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Heenokey Yaarede na7a, Yaaredey Malaal7ela na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Malaal7eli Qaynaane na7a, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Qaynaaney Heenose na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Heenosey Seete na7a, Seetey Addaame na7a,</para>
  <para style="q1">Addaamey Xoossaa na7a.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi paacettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Maato 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi Yorddaanose Shaafappe simmida mela Ayyaanay iya bazzo efis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan oytamu gallasinne qamma xalahen paacettis. He gallasatan aykkoka moonna gam77ida gisho wurssethan koshattis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xalahey iyaakko, “Neeni Xoossaa na7a gidikko ane hayssi shuchchay uythu gido gada kiitta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Asi uytha xalaalan deenna geetettidi xaafettis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Zaare 8:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Xalahey Yesuusa adussa dere bolla kessidi ha alamiya kawotethata ayfe qiphi zaaranaw bessis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xalahey, “Ha ubbaas maataynne bonchchoy taw imettis. Taani dosida oodeskka immiya gisho new immana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, neeni taw goynniko ubbay new gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa, iya xalaala goynna geetettidi xaafettis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Zaare 6:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wurssethan Xalahey Yesuusa Yerusalaame efidi Xoossa Keethas huu7iya bolla essidi, “Neeni Xoossaa na7a gidikko ane duge sa7an nena yegga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ays giikko,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nena naagiya Kiitanchchota</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay ne gisho kiittana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz 91:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Entti ne tohoy shuchchan dhubettonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">bantta kushiyan dhoqqu oothidi nena denthana’ geetettidi xaafettis”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ne Godaa Xoossaa paaccofa geetettidi xaafettis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Zaare 6:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Xalahey Yesuusa paaciya wurssidaappe guye hara injje wode demmana gakkanaw iyappe shaakettis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Galiilan tamaarsso oykkis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Maato 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi Ayyaana wolqqan kumidi Galiila simmis. Iya sunthay heeran de7iya biitta ubban keyis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>I Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelidi tamaarssis; asay ubbay iya galatidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaappe I diccida katamaa Naazirete yis. Kase meezetidayssada Sambbaata gallas Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelis. Nabbabanawukka denddi eqqis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nabiya Isayaasa maxaafay iyaw imettin, maxaafaa dooyidi, geetettidi xaafettidayssa demmis:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Godaa Ayyaanay ta bolla de7ees,</para>
  <para style="q2">manqotas Wonggelaa odana mela</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay tana dooris.</para>
  <para style="q1">Qashettidayssatas biletethi,</para>
  <para style="q2">qooqidayssata xeelisanaasinne</para>
  <para style="q2">un77ettidayssata birshshana mela,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa 61:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossay keehanaw qoppida laythaa odana mela tana kiittis”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, maxaafaa xaaxidi haggaazeyssas immidi tamaarssanaw uttis. Ayhude Woosa Keethan de7iya asati ubbay caddi xeellosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>I, “Hayssi hintte haythan hintte si7iya ha maxaafaa qaalay hachchi polettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ubbay iyabaa darssidi odettoosona. Qassi iya doonappe keyaa aadho keehatethan kumida qaalan malaalettishe, “Hayssi Yoosefa na7aa gidenneyye?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>I, “ ‘Neno dhale aawaw nena ashsha, Qifirnahoomen ne oothidabaa nu si77oyssa qassi hayssan ne kataman ootha’ yaagiya leemisuwan hintte tana gaanayssas sidhey baawa” yaagis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassi, “Tuma odays; nabey ba yelettida biittan bonchchettena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoha 4:44</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ta hinttew tuma odays; saloy heedzu laythinne bagga gorddettin mino koshi biitta ubban de7iya Eliyaasa wode daro am77eti Isra7eelen de7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Kawo 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Eliyaasi enttafe issinnekokka kiitettibeenna. Shin Serapitan de7iya am77eeko kiitettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Kawo 17:8-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nabiya Elssa7e wode Isra7eelen daro baro hargganchchoti de7oosona. Shin Soore uraa Ni7imaaneppe attin oonikka paxibeenna” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Kawo 5:1-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ayhude Woosa Keethan de7iya asay ubbay hessa si7ida wode daro yilotidosona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantta uttida bessaafe denddidi zuma bolla keexettida katamaappe gaxa kessidi sugi yeddanaw aafo doona efidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin I entta giddora kanthidi aadhdhis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi tuna ayyaanaa kessis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yaappe Galiila biittan de7iya Qifirnahoome katama bis. Yan Sambbaata gallas asaa tamaarssis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>I tamaarssey maatara gidiya gisho ubbay iya timirttiyan malaalettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Maato 7:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Maz 91:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ayhude Woosa Keethan tuna ayyaanay oykkida uray de7ees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>I, “Naazirete Yesuusa nuna ays waaysay nuuppe haakka; neeni yiday nuna dhayssanaaseyye? Neeni ooneekko taani erays. Neeni Xoossaafe yida Geeshsha” yaagidi waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi tuna ayyaanaakko, “Si7i gada ha uraappe keya” yaagidi hanqis. Tuna ayyaanay uraa asaa ubbaa sinthan holi yeggidi aykkoka qohonna yeddidi keyis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asa ubbay malaalettidosona. Wolikko, “Hanos, hayssi aybi timirtte? Tuna ayyaanata maataninne wolqqan kiittees; enttika keyosona” yaagidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Iya sunthay heera ubban keyis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi daro hargganchchota pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Maato 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Ayhude Woosa Keethafe keyidi Simoona soo gelis. Simoona machche aayiya mino qoxo misha harggen sakettasu. Iyo pathana mela Yesuusa woossidosona. <verse number="39" style="v"/>I hiixaakko shiiqi hokkidi I harggiya hanqis. Mishay aggin ellesa denddada entta mokkasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Away wullana hanishin dumma dumma harggiyan oykettida asaa iyaakko ehidosona. I issuwa issuwa bolla ba kushiya wothidi pathis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanati qassi, “Neeni, Xoossaa na7aa” gidi waassishe daro asaappe keyidosona. Shin I enttana hanqis. I Kiristtoosa gideyssa entti eriya gisho, issibaakka odettonna mela diggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Buroo wonttiya wode Yesuusi issi geema bessi bis. Asay koyishe I de7iya bessaa yidosona. Enttafe I shaakettidi boonna mela butetidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shin I, “Taani hara katamata bada Xoossaa kawotethaa Wonggelaa markkattanaw bessees. Ta kiitettiday hessassa” yaagis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yihuda biittan de7iya Ayhude Woosa Keethan sabbakis.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi doorida koyro tamaareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Maato 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusi Gensareexe Abbaa matan eqqidashin daro asay iya yuushuwa un77ethidi, I tamaarssiya Xoossaa qaala si7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Maato 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mar 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan nam77u wogolota haatha gaxan de7eyssata be7is. Molo oykkiya asati wogolotappe wodhdhidi bantta gitiya meeccosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wogolotappe Simoonayssan gelidi biittaafe guuthi giddo shiishana mela oychchis. Yaatidi, he wogoluwa bolla uttidi asaa tamaarssis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ba tamaarssuwa onggidaappe guye Simoonakko, “Gede ciimmuwako shiishada moluwa oykkanaw hintte gitiya yeggite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simooni zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, qamma kumethaa daaburishe aqidi aykkoka oykkibookko, shin ne giikko gitiya yeggana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yoha 21:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti gitiya yeggida wode gitey daakettana gakkanaw daro molo oykkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yoha 21:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hara wogoluwan de7iya bantta laggeti yidi, banttana maaddana mela wuttidi xeegidosona. Entti yidi nam77u wogolota, haathan mitettana gakkanaw molon kunthidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simoona Phexiroosi hessa be7ida wode Yesuusa sinthan kunddidi, “Godaw, taani nagaranchcho asi gidiya gisho, taappe shaaketta” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa I giday inne iyara de7eyssati oykkida moluwa darotethan malaalettida gishossa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qassi Simoona lagge gidida Zabdiyoosa nayti Yayqoobaranne Yohaannisara malaalettidosona. Yesuusi Simoonakko, “Babbofa! Hizappe neeni ase oykkiya asi gidana” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Entti wogolota gaxa shiishidaappe guye ubbaa aggidi Yesuusa kaallidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi baro hargganchchuwa pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Maato 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi katamatappe issuwan de7ishin issi baro harggen <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baro hargge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baro harggey asa galbba bolla keyaa hargge. Isra7eele biittan baro hargganchchoti hara asaappe dummattidi de7oosonappe attin asaara gahettokona.</char></note> oykettida asi he kataman de7ees. He uray Yesuusa be7idi iya sinthan gufannidi, “Godaw, ne shene gidikko tana geeshshanaw dandda7aasa” gidi woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba kushiya yeddi bochchidi, “Ee, ta shene; geeya” yaagis. Iira baro harggey uraappe kichchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Hayssa oodeskka odoppa, shin bada nenatethaa Ayhude kahiniya bessa. Ne geeyidayssas markka gidana mela Musey kiittida yarshshuwa yarshsha” gidi kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leewe 14:1-32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gidoshin, iya sunthay kaseppe aadhdhi dalggishe bis. Daro asay I odiyabaa si7anawunne bantta harggiyafe paxanaw yoosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi daro wode geema bessi bidi woossees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi gunddaa pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Maato 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusi tamaarssishin Galiilappenne Yihuda heera ubbaafe qassi Yerusalaameppekka yida Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti yan uttidosona. Asaa pathiya Godaa wolqqayka iyara de7ees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>He wode asay issi gundda asi halara tookkidi ehidosona. Soo gelssidi iya sinthan wothanaw qoppidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin asaa darotethaafe denddoyssan soo gelssanaw xoonettidi keethaa bolla keyidi, kaara qawuxidi, hargganchchuwa halara asaa shaakkidi Yesuusa sinthan yeggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta ammanuwa be7idi, “La addiyaw, ne nagaray qushettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti, “Hayssi Xoossaa bolla yaagidi odettey oonee? Issi Xoossaafe attin haray nagara quchchanaw dandda7ey oonee?” yaagidi qoppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta qofaa erida gisho enttako, “Hintte wozanan hessatho ays qoppeetii? <verse number="23" style="v"/>‘Ne nagaray qushettis geyssafenne denddada ba geyssafe awussi kawuyii?’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin ta hessa giday Asa Na7ay sa7a bolla nagara quchchanaw maati de7eyssa hintte erana melassa.” Hessafe kaallidi, gundda uraakko, “Dendda; ne alggaa tookkada ne soo ba” yaagis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>I ellesi denddidi entta sinthan eqqis I tookettidi yida alggaa tookkidi Xoossaa galatishe ba soo bis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode ubbayka malaalettidosona. Xoossaa galatishe, “Hachchi gita malaata be7ida” yaagidi yashettidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Leewe xeegis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Maato 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi yaappe keyidi bis. Leewe geetettiya issi qaraxa qanxiseyssi qaraxa qanxisiya bessan uttidayssa be7idi, “Tana kaalla” yaagis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>I ubbabaa aggi denddidi iya kaallis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>He Leewey ba son gita gibira giigisis. Daro qaraxa qanxiseyssatinne hara asati kathaa maanaw uttidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti, “Qaraxa qanxeyssataranne nagaranchchotara ays meetinne uyeetii?” yaagidi Yesuusa tamaareta bolla zuuzummidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luuqa 15:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Hargganchchotassafe attin paxatas aakime koshshenna. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Taani nagaranchchota maarotaakko zaaranaassafe attin geeshshata xeeganaw yabiikke” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusakko, “Yohaannisa tamaareti daro wode xoomosona, woossosona; qassi Farisaaweta tamaaretikka hessatho oothoosona. Shin neyssati ubba wode moosonanne uyoosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Mushuray enttara de7ishin xeegettida asay xoomana mela oothanaw dandda7etii? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shin mushuray enttafe shaakettana gallasay yaana, he wode entti xoomana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qassi yaagidi leemiso odis; “Ooratha ma7oppe peedhidi gal77a ma7o bolla sikkey oonikka baawa. Hessatho oothiko ooratha ma7uwa peedhees, oorathay gal77aas giigenna. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mal7antto woyniya gal77a ogoron qoliya oonikka baawa. Hessa oothiko, ooratha woyney gal77a ogoruwa dhusees; woyney gukkees ogoroykka maaddonabaa gidees. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ooratha woyney ooratha ogoron qolettanaw bessees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hiza, caalay lo77o giya gisho, caala woyne uyi simmidi mal7antto koyey oonikka baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Sambbaatabaa oyshettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Maato 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi Sambbaata gallas Yesuusi gistte gade giddora aadhdhees. Yesuusa tamaareti tiya bangga duuthidi bantta kushen shirkkidi moosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Zaare 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweta giddofe issoti issoti, “Sambbaata gallas oothanaw bessonnabaa ays ootheetii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako zaaridi, “Dawitey koshattida wode baara de7eyssatara issife oothoyssa nabbabibeekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Saamu 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossa Keethi gelidi Ayhude kahineta xalaalas bessiya daabbuwa mis; baara de7eyssataskka immis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leewe 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi, “Asa Na7ay Sambbaata Goda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hara Sambbaata gallas Yesuusi Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelidi tamaarssees. He bessan ushachcha kushey gunddida issi asi de7ees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti iya mootanaw gaaso koyidi Sambbaata gallas pathiko be7ana gidi naagoosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi entta qofaa eridi kushey gunddida uraakko, “Denddada asaa gidduwan eqqa” yaagis. Uraykka denddi eqqis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ane ta hinttena issibaa oychchays; Sambbaata gallas oothanaw bessey lo77obayeyye iitabaye? Shemppo ashoyye woykko dhaysso?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi iya yuushuwan de7iya asaa yuushshi xeellidi uraakko, “Ne kushiya piddi ootha” yaagis. Uraykka I gidayssada oothin kushey paxis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti daro yilotidosona. Yesuusa bolla ay oothinoo gidi bantta giddon maqettidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi tammanne nam77u hawaareta dooris</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Maato 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>He wode gallasatappe issuwan Yesuusi woossanaw deriya bolla keyis. Qamma kumethaa Xoossaa woossishe aqis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wonttethe ba tamaareta xeegidi entta giddofe tammanne nam77ata dooris. Enttanakka, “Hawaareta” gidi sunthis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enttika, Phexiroosa gidi sunthida Simoona, iya ishaa Inddiriyasa, Yayqooba, Yohaannisa, Filiphphoosa, Bartolomiyoosa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Maatoosa, Toomasa, Ilfiyoosa na7aa Yayqooba, ba biittaas mishettiya Simoona, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yayqooba na7aa Yihudanne Yesuusa aathi immida Asqoroota Yihuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttara issife deriyappe wodhdhidi denbba bessan eqqis. Iya tamaaretappe daroti he bessan de7oosona Yihuda biitta ubbaafe Yerusalaameppe, Xiroosappenne Sidoona abbaa gaxappe yida daro asay de7ees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entti yiday I tamaarssiyabaa si7anawunne bantta harggiyafe paxanaassa. Tuna ayyaanan waayettiya asatikka paxidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wolqqay iyappe keyidi asa ubbaa pathiya gisho asay iya bochchanaw koyoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ba tamaaretakko xeellidi hayssada yaagis:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hinttenoo, manqoto, hintte anjjettidayssata;</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossaa kawotethay hinttessa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hintte ha77i koshatteyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte kallana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hintte ha77i yeekkeyssati anjjettidayssata</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte miicana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asay hinttena Asa Na7aa gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2">ixxiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2">hinttena hiliya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2">hinttena entti toochchiya wodenne,</para>
  <para style="q2">iita sunthi entti hinttew immiya wode</para>
  <para style="q1">hintte anjjettidayssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:14">Leemi 4:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hekko, hintte woytoy salon gita gidiya gisho he wode ufayssan guppite. Ays giikko, beni entta aawati nabeta bolla hessada oothidosona.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Taari 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Ha@O 7:52</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Shin dureto hinttena ayye;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte ha77i lo77o duussaa ekkideta.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ha77i kallidayssato hinttena ayye;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte koshattana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ha77i miiceyssato hinttenoshsho</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte kayottananne yeekkana.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Asi ubbay hintte lo77otethaa xalaala odiya wode hinttena ayye.</para>
  <para style="q2">Entta aawati beni worddanchcho nabeta bolla hessada oothidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Hintte morkketa siiqite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Maato 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Shin tana si7iya hinttes ta odays; hintte morkketa siiqite hinttena ixxeyssatas lo77obaa oothite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hinttena qanggeyssata anjjite, hinttena naaqqeyssatas woossite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Issi bagga shakalaa baqqeyssas hankko baggaaka bessa. Ne laxana ekkana geyssas ne shaamiziyakka gujjada imma. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nena woossiya ubbaas imma; neeppe ekkida oonakka zaaro gada oychchofa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Asay hinttew oothana mela hintte koyabaa ubbaa hintteka asaas oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:17">Maato 7:17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Hintte hinttena dosiya asata xalaala dosikko, ay galati hinttew de7ii? Hari attoshin, nagaranchchotikka banttana siiqeyssata siiqoosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hinttew lo77obaa ootheyssata xalaalas lo77obaa oothiko hinttew ay galati de7ii? Nagaranchchotikka hessada oothoosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Tal77e zaarana asa xalaalas hintte tal77iko ay dumma galatetteetii? Nagaranchchotikka guye zaarana asi be7idi tal77osona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Harata bolla pirddofite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Shin hintte morkketa siiqite enttaw lo77obaa oothite. Guye ekkanaw qopponna tal77ite. Hessan hintte ekkana woytoy gita gidana. Hintte Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa nayta gidana. I bana galatonnayssatasinne iitatas keeha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hintte aaway keeha gidoyssada hintteka keeha gidite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Asa bolla pirddofite; hintte bolla pirddettenna. Hintte borettonna mela oonakka boroppite. Atto giite; Xoossay hinttew atto gaana. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Immite; hinttew imettana. Hintte makkidaban hinttew zaari makettana, ubbarakka lo77o makkiyaban baqqidi, suuddi kunthidi, laalettana gakkanaw hinttew maketi imettana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi yaagidi enttaw leemiso odis; “Qooqey qooqe kaalethanaw dandda7ii? Kaalethiko nam77ayka woli ekkidi aafon wullokonayye?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Maato 15:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>Tamaarey asttamaareppe aadhdhenna. Shin loythi tamaarida uray ba asttamaariyatho hanees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Maato 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoha 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ne ishaa ayfiyaan de7iya buuriya ays be7ay? Ne ayfiyaan de7iya tuussi daaneyssa ays be7ikki? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ne ayfiyaan de7iya tuussi daaneyssa be7onna ne ishaakko, ‘Ta ishaw ne ayfiyaan de7iya buuriya kesso’ gaanaw waana dandda7ey? Neno cubbuwaw, koyrottada ne ayfiyaan de7iya tuussi daaneyssa kessa. Hessafe guye, ne ishaa ayfiyaan de7iya buuriya kessanaw geeshshada xeellana.</para>
  <para style="s">Mithaanne iya ayfiyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Lo77o mithi iita ayfe ayfenna; hessadakka iita mithi lo77o ayfe ayfena. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ayfe ayfiyaa mithi ubbay ba ayfiyaan erettees. Agunthafe balase mitha ayfey maxettenna qassi laadeppe woyne ayfey maxettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Maato 12:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lo77o asi ba wozanan kumida lo77obaappe lo77obaa kessees. Iita asi ba wozanan kumida iitabaappe iitabaa kessees. Asi ba wozanan kumidi palahidabaappe ba doonan haasayees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:34">12:34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Keethe keexiya nam77u asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Maato 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Ta geyssa ootheketa, shin yaatin ays tana, ‘Godaw, Godaw, geeti?’ <verse number="47" style="v"/>Taakko yeynne ta qaala si7idi poliya ubbay oona daaniyakko ta hinttena bessana. <verse number="48" style="v"/>I keethe keexanaw ziqqi oothi, olla bookkidi, garssan de7iya zaalla bolla keethaa essida cincca uraa daanees. Di7oy di77idi he keethaa sugis, shin minthidi keexida gisho, qaaxxanaw dandda7ibeenna. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Shin ta qaala si7idi oothonay ba keethaa shafe biitta bolla keexida uraa daanees. Di7oy di77idi he keethaa sugida wode ellesidi kunddis. He keethay wolqqaama kunddethi kunddis” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mato halaqaa ammanuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Maato 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yoha 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa ubbaa asaa sinthan tamaarssidi onggidaappe guye, Qifirnahoome giya biittaa bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He bessan issi mato halaqay de7ees. I daro dosiya aylley harggettidi hayqos gakkis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>I Yesuusabaa si7ida wode ba aylliya pathana mela iya woosso gidi issi issi Ayhude cimata Yesuusakko kiittis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kiitettidayssati, Yesuusakko bidi, “Ne iyaw hayssa oothanaw bessees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ha uray nu asaa dosees, Ayhude Woosa Keethaka keexis” gidi minthi woossidosona <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusikka enttara bis.</para>
  <para style="p">Mato halaqaa sookko matiya wode ba laggeta iyaakko kiittidi, “Godaw, ta kaarappe garssan ne gelanaw ta bessonna gisho, daaburoppa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Takka tana ne sinthe shiiqanaw bessiya asi gada qoppike. Shin ne issi qaala oda; ta aylley paxana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taw taappe bollara halaqay de7ees, taappe garssan ta kiittiya wotaaddareti de7oosona. Issuwa, ‘Ba’ giikko bees, hankkuwa, ‘Haaya’ giikko yees. Ta aylliyakko, ‘Hanno ootha’ giikko oothees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa si7ida wode malaalettis. Guye simmidi baara yaa asaakko, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; hari attoshin Isra7eelenkka hayssa mela gita ammano demmabiikke” yaagis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiitettidayssati soo simmiya wode aylley paxin demmidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Am77ee na7aa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Guutha wodeppe guye Yesuusi Nayne katamaa bis. Iya tamaaretaranne hara daro asati iyara bidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>I katamaa gelana haniya wode aha tookkida daro asati katamaappe keyosona. Hayqqida na7ay ba aayes issuwa, iyakka am77o gidada da7awusu. Katama asaappe daroti iira de7oosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Goday iyo be7ida wode qadhettidi, “Yeekkofa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shiiqidi halaa bochchin tookkida asati eqqidosona. Yesuusi, “La, yalagaw dendda” yaagis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hayqqidayssi denddi uttidi oda oykkis. Yesuusi na7aa ekkidi aayes immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Asa ubbay yashettidi, “Gita nabey nu giddon denddis; Xoossay ba asaa be7is” yaagidi Xoossaa galatidosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iya sunthay Yihudaninne he heeran de7iya biitta ubban si7ettis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Xammaqiya Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisa tamaareti hessa ubbaa Yohaannisas odidosona. I entta giddofe nam77ata xeegidi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Yaana geetettiday neneyye? Woykko haraa naaginoo?” yaagidi oychchite gidi Godaakko kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Asati Yesuusakko bidi, Xammaqiya Yohaannisi, “Yaana geetettiday neneyye? Woykko haraa naaginoo?” giite gidi nuna neekko kiittis yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He saatenkka Yesuusi daro asaa harggiyafe pathis. Tuna ayyaanata kessis, qooqida ayfiyakka xeelisis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yohaannisa matappe kiitettidi yidayssatakko, “Bidi hintte be7idayssanne si7idayssa Yohaannisas odite. Ayfe qooqeti xeellosona, gunddati birshshettidi hamuttoosona, baro hargganchchoti geeyosona, tulleti si7oosona, hayqqidayssati hayqoppe denddoosona, manqotas Wonggelay sabbakettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tanan dhubettonna oonikka anjjettidayssa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yohaannisi kiittidayssati bidaappe guye Yesuusi asaas Yohaannisabaa yaagidi odis: “Biitta bazzo hintte ay be7anaw keyidetii? Carkkoy qaathiya maata be7anaaseye? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yaatin, ay be7anaw keyidetii? Kitte ma7o ma77ida asaa be7anaaseyye? Kitte ma7o ma77idayssatinne sa7i injjetida asay kawo keethan de7oosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yaatin, ay be7anaw keyidetii? Nabiya be7anaaseye? Ee, ta yaagays: hintte be7anaw keyiday nabeppe aadhdheyssa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>‘Ne ogiya ne sinthan giigisiya</para>
  <para style="q2">ta kiitanchchuwa neeppe sinthe ta kiittana’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettiday iyassa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; maccasappe yelettidayssata giddofe Yohaannisappe aadhdhey baawa. Xoossaa kawotethan ubbaafe guuxeyssi, I ubbaafe gita gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, Yesuusa qaala si7ida qaraxa qanxiseyssati ubbay Yohaannisa kushen xammaqettidi Xoossay xillo gideyssa qonccisidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Maato 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luuqa 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti Yohaannisa kushen xammaqettonna ixxidi Xoossaa zoriya leqisidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesuusi kaallidi hayssada yaagis: “Hiza, ha wodiya yeletethaa aybira daaniso? Enttika oona daanoona? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Giya giddon uttidi woli xeegidi, ‘Nu hinttew suusul77e punnin, hintte yexxeketa. Nu sabbidi zeleelin, hintte yeekkeketa’ yaagiya nayta daanosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisi moonnanne uyonna yin, ‘Iita ayyaanara de7ees gideta.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay mishenne uyishe yin, ‘Yarambbanne ushanchcho, qaraxa qanxiseyssatanne nagaranchchota dabbo’ gideta. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hiza, cinccatethaa tumatethay iya nayta ubbaa matan erettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi maccasiya Yesuusa shitto tiyasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Issi Farisaawey Yesuusa kathi muzanaw ba soo xeegis. I Farisaawiya soo bidi gayta bolla uttis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>He kataman issi nagaranchcho maccasi de7iyara Yesuusi Farisaawiya son gibira bolla de7eyssa si7ida wode daro al77o philqqaaxe shitto ekkada yasu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Maato 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoha 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesuusas guye baggara, iya tohuwa matan eqqada yeekkashe iya tohuwa ba afuthaara laakethawsu. Ba binaanara iya tohuwa quchchashenne yeerashe shitto tiyasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Gibira giigisida Farisaawey hessa be7ida wode ba wozanan, “Hayssi nabe gidiyakko ha maccasiya iya bochchiyara ooneekko qassi iya nagaranchcho gideyssakka I eranashin” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Simoona, ta new odiyabay de7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">I, “Asttamaariyaw, taw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Nam77u asati issi uraappe miishe tal77idosona. Issoy ichchashu xeetu bira hankkoy qassi ishatamu bira tal77idosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nam77ayka tal77iya cigganaw xoonettin, nam77ataskka tal77iya maaris. Hiza, ha nam77atappe he uraa daro dosanay new awussa daanii” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Simooni, “Daro acoy maarettida uray daro dosana daanees” yaagis. Yesuusi, “Ne tuma pirddadasa” yaagis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi maccaseekko simmi xeellidi, Simoonakko, “Hanno maccasiw be7ay? Taani ne soo gelin hari attin ne taw toho haathe immabaakka, shin iya ta tohuwa ba afuthan laakothada ba binaanan quchchasu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Neeni tana yeera ekkabaakka, shin iya ta ne soo geloodeppe doomada ta tohuwa yeero aggabukku. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Neeni ta huu7iyan zayte tiyabaka, shin iya ta tohuwa shitto tiyawusu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Iya tana daro dosida gisho I daro nagaray atto geetettis. Iya guutha nagaray atto geetettiday guuthara dosees.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesuusi maccaseekko, “Ne nagaray atto geetettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Iyara issife gaytan uttidi miya imathati, “Nagara atto yaagey, I hayssi oonee?” yaagidi bantta wozanan qoppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi maccaseekko, “Ne ammanoy nena ashshis; saro ba” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa mokkida maccasata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xoossaa kawotethaa Wonggelaa sabbakishe katamaaranne gutaara aadhdhis. He wode tammanne nam77u hawaareti iyara de7oosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qassi tuna ayyaanaappenne dumma dumma harggiyafe paxida issi issi maccasati iyara de7oosona. Enttika, laappun tuna ayyaanati keyida Magdela Mayraamo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Maato 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mar 15:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luuqa 23:49</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Heroodisa shuumaa Kuuza machchiw Yohaanna, Soosinnaranne qassi hara daroti enttana miishen maaddeyssati de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daro asay dumma dumma katamaappe iyaakko shiiqin leemison enttaw odis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Issi goshshanchchoy zerethi zeranaw keyis. I zerishin issi issi zerethay oge gaxan wodhdhidi yedhdhettis, salo kafoti maxidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Harati shaalloy garssan de7iya biitta bolla wodhdhidosona. Buroo dolida mela biittan laahoy baynna gisho miccidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hara zerethay qassi aguntha giddon wodhdhis. Agunthaara wolla diccida gisho agunthay cuullidi bessan ashshis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Harati lo77o biitta bolla wodhdhidosona. Dolida wode xeetu kushe ayfidosona.” Hessa odi onggidi, ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Si7iya haythi de7iya ubbay si7o” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti, “Ha leemisuwa birshshethay aybee?” yaagidi oychchidosona <verse number="10" style="v"/>I, “Xoossaa kawotethaa xuuraa erana mela hinttew imettis. Shin harati be7ishe demmonna mela, si7ishe akeekonna mela leemison odays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hiza, ha leemisuwa birshshethay hayssa: zerethi yaagettiday Xoossaa qaala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Oge gaxan wodhdhida zerethay qaala si7eyssata. Gidoshin, entti ammanidi attonna mela Xalahey qaala entta wozanaappe maxi digees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shaalloy garssan de7iya biitta bolla wodhdhida zerethay qaala si7idi ufayssan ekkeyssata. Entti ha77is ammanoosonappe attin xaphoy baynna gisho paacey gakkiya wode ellesidi kaddoosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Aguntha giddon zerettidayssati qaala si7eyssata. Enttika alamiya qofan, duretethaaninne sa7aa duussaa miikkotethan cuulettidi besseyssada ayfibookkona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lo77o biittan wodhdhida zerethay lo77o wozanan qaala si7idi naageyssatanne dandda7an minnidi ayfe ayfeyssata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Xomppe xomppidi, daachcho kammey woykko arssafe garssan wothey deenna. Geliya asi be7ana mela dhoqqa bessan wothees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Maato 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luuqa 11:33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, qoncce keyonna qosettidi attiyaabay, erettonna geemmidi attiyaabay deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Maato 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luuqa 12:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Hiza, hintte qaala waati si7iyakko akeekite. De7iya ubbaas guzhetidi imettana, baynnayssas hari attoshin iyaw de7iya guuthiyaka iyappe ekettana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Maato 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luuqa 19:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa aayeranne ishatara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Maato 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusa aayeranne ishatara iyaakko yidosona. Shin asaa darotethaafe denddoyssan iya demmanaw dandda7ibookkona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Issi asi Yesuusakko, “Ne aayeranne ne ishatara nena koyidi karen naagoosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Xoossaa qaala si7idi qaala ooson peeshsheyssati ubbay taw aayonne taw isha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi haathaa zuliya seeris</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Maato 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusaranne iya tamaaretara issife wogolon gelidi, “Abbaa pinnoos” yaagis. Enttika baanaw denddidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Abbaa bollara entti pinnanaw bishin Yesuusi dhiskkis. Qopponna mino carkkoy abbaa bolla denddis. Haathay wogoluwan gelin wogoloy mitetethi oykkiya wode ubbay babbidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti iyaakko shiiqidi, “Nu Godaw, nu Godaw, nu dhayos yaagidi” Yesuusa denthidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi denddidi carkkuwanne gotiya seeris. Ellesidi carkkoynne gotey woppu gis. Sarotethayka simmis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Hintte ammanoy awunee” yaagis. Enttika, yayyishenne malaalettishe issoy issuwako, “Carkkoynne haathay kiitetteyssi, I hayssi oonee” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuna ayyaanaappe yedettida uraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Maato 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Abbaa pinnidi Galiila baggara de7iya Gerggesoone biittaa gakkidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesuusi wogoluwappe keyidi sa7an wodhdhishin tuna ayyaanan oykettida uray katamaappe keyidi iyara gayttis. Daro laythi afili ma77onna kallo duufon de7eesippe attin soo gelenna. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusa be7ida wode iya sinthan gufannidi, ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa na7aw Yesuusa neera taw aybi issifetethi de7ii? Hayyana tana ha77i un77ethofarkkii” yaagis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa I giday, tuna ayyaanay uraappe keyana mela Yesuusi hanqettida gishossa. Daro wode tuna ayyaanay iya haarida gisho santhalaataninne toho qachchiya biraatan qashettidi naagettees. Shin qashuwa duuthidi tuna ayyaanan laagettidi bazzo gelis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ne sunthay oonee” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">I, daro tuna ayyaanati iya oykkidi gisho bana, “Leegiyona” gis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanati banttana Si7oole kiittonna mela woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>He bessan zooze bolla miya guduntho wudey hamuttees. Hini gudunthotan gelino gidi woossidosona, ikka ‘Gelite’ gis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanati uraappe keyidi gudunthotan gelidosona. Wudey deriyappe duge gurgguxidi abban gelis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Henthanchchoti hanidayssa be7ida wode woxxi bidi, katamaninne guta ubban odidosona. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Asay hanidabaa be7anaw keyidi Yesuusakko yidosona. Tuna ayyaanay keyida uray ma7o ma77idi, iya wozanay simmin, Yesuusa toho matan uttidayssa demmidi yayyidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Iya be7ida asay tuna ayyaanan oykettida uray waanidi paxidaakko odidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gerggesoone yuushuwan de7iya asay gita yashshi yashettidi Yesuusi bantta matappe baana mela woossidosona. I wogoluwan gelidi guye simmis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanay keyida uray Yesuusara daanaw woossis. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi iyaakko, “Ne soo simma, Xoossay ay mela gitabaa new oothidaakko oda” yaagidi mooyzis. Uraykka Yesuusi ay mela gitabaa iyaw oothidaakko katama ubban markkattishe bis.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqqida na7iwunne Yesuusa ma7uwa bochchida maccasiw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Maato 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Asay naagidi gam77ida gisho Yesuusi simmiya wode mokki ekkidosona. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqa gidida Iyaroosa giya uray ba soo yaana mela Yesuusa tohuwa bolla wodhdhidi woossis. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Iyaw tammanne nam77u laythi gidida macca na7a de7iyara sakettada hayqos gakkada de7awusu. Yesuusi biya wode asay iya un77ethees. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tammanne nam77u laythi suuthi goggishe gam77ida maccasi de7iyara de7awusu. Iya baw de7iya miishiya aakimetas immada onggasu. Shin paxanaw dandda7abukku. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Iya Yesuusas guye baggara shiiqada, iya afilaa macaraa bochchasu, sohuwara goggiya suuthay eqqi aggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Tana bochchiday oonee?” yaagis. Ubbay ‘Nu bochchibookko’ yaagin, Phexiroosi, “Asttamaariyaw, daro asay kaallishininne un77ethishin be7ashe waanada, ‘Tana bochchiday oonee?’ gay” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Issi asi tana bochchis; ays giikko, wolqqi taappe keyoyssi taw erettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Maccasiya, ibay qonccidayssa erida wode kokkorashe yada Yesuusa tohuwa bolla kunddasu. Ays bochchidaakkonne waanada ellesada paxidaakko asaa ubbaa sinthan markkattasu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>I, “Ta naatte ne ammanoy nena pathis; saron ba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesuusi oda onggonna de7ishin, Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqaa, Iyaroosa sooppe issi asi yidi, “Iyaroosa, ne na7iya hayqqasu; asttamaariya mela daaburissofa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi hessa si7idi Iyaroosakko, “Babbofa! Ammana, ne na7iya paxana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesuusi Iyaroosa soo gakkida wode Phexiroosappe, Yohaannisappe, Yayqoobappe, na7ee aawappenne aayeppe attin hari gelana mela koyibeenna. <verse number="52" style="v"/>He bessan de7iya asa ubbay na7ees mishettidi yeekkishin, Yesuusi, “Yeekkofite! Na7iya dhiskkasuppe attin hayqqabuukku” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Asay na7iya hayqqidayssa eriya gisho, iya oda leqqidi miicidosona. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi na7ee kushiya oykkidi, “Naatte dendda” yaagis. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na7ees shemppoy simmin dendda eqqasu. Yesuusi enttako, “Iwu miyabaa immite” yaagis. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Na7ee aawaranne aayera malaalettidosona. Shin Yesuusi hayssa, “Oodeskka odoppite” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi tammanne nam77u hawaareta kiittis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Maato 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi tammanne nam77u hawaareta baakko xeegidi, tuna ayyaanata kessana melanne hargge ubbaa pathana mela wolqqanne maata immis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossaa kawotethaabaa markkattanaadanne hargganchchota pathanaada kiittis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>I enttako, “Xam77a gidin ogoro gidin kathi gidin miishe gidin laammi ma77iya afila gidin oges gidi aykkoka oykkofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luuqa 10:4-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>He katamaappe hintte keyana gakkanaw imathatethan hintte gelidasuwan gam77ite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Oonikka hinttena mokkonna ixxiko he katamaappe keyishe enttaw markka gidana mela hintte tohuwan de7iya bana pittidi keyite.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Enttika kiitettidayssada keyidi Wonggelaa odishenne dumma dumma gutatan hargganchchota pathishe aadhdhidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Galiila biittaa haariya Heroodisi Yesuusi oothidabaa ubbaa si7ida wode dagammis. Ays giikko, issi issi asati Yohaannisi hayqoppe denddonna aggenna yaagosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Maato 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luuqa 9:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Baggati, “Eeliyaasi qonccis” goosona; harati qassi, “Beni nabetappe issoy hayqoppe denddis” yaagidi odettoosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Heroodisi, “Yohaannisa qoodhiya ta qanxisada wodhas. Yaatin, hayssatho yaagettidi iyabaa odettey, I oonee?” yaagidi ba ayfen be7anaw koyees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ichchashu mukulu asaa muzis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maato 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tammanne nam77u hawaareti guye simmi yidi, entti oothidabaa ubbaa Yesuusas odidosona. I enttana ekkidi Beetesayda katamaappe gaxa efis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin daro asay Yesuusa gideyssa eridi iya kaallidosona. I entta mokki ekkidi Xoossaa kawotethaabaa tamaarssis; paxanaw koyeyssatakka pathis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sa7i omarssiya wode tammanne nam77u hawaareti iyaakko shiiqidi, “Nu de7ey bazzo biitta gidiya gisho asay dumma dumma gutatanne katamata bidi, kathinne aqiyaso koyana mela asaa moyza” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin I, “Enttaw miyabaa hintte immite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Nuus de7ey ichchashu uythinne nam77u molo gidiya gisho, ha asaas gidiya kathi nuuni bidi shammonna ixxiko gidenna” yaagidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>He bessan ichchashu mukulu gidiya addeti de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Ishataman ishataman shaakki shaakki asaa utisite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti, I kiittidayssada asaa utisidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>I ichchashu uythaanne nam77u molota ekkidi, salo xeellidi, Xoossaa galatidi, meenthidi asaa ubbaa gathana mela ba tamaaretas immis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ubbay midi kallidosona. Enttafe attida tiifey tammanne nam77u gayta kumethi gidis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusi ooneekko markkattis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Maato 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba xalaala woossishin, iya tamaareti iyaakko yidosona. I, “Asay tana oona goonaa?” gidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi “Issoti issoti, ‘Xammaqiya Yohaannisa, baggati Eliyaasa, harati qassi, beni nabetappe issoy hayqoppe denddis’ yaagosona” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Maato 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luuqa 9:7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Yaatin hintte tana oona geeti” yaagis. Phexiroosi, “Neeni Xoossaafe kiitettida Kiristtoosa” yaagidi zaaris.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:20-28">Yoha 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar 8:30-9:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi hayssa oodeskka odoppite gidi minthidi odis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi, “Asa Na7ay daro metuwa ekkana. Biitta cimatan, kahine halaqatan, higge asttamaaretan aadhdhi imettana. Entti iya wodhana, shin I heedzantho gallas hayqoppe denddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi asaa ubbaako, “Tana kaallanaw koyey oonikka de7ikko bana kaddo, ba masqaliya gallas gallas tookkidi tana kaallo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Maato 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luuqa 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ba shemppiw ashshanaw koya ubbay iyo dhayssees, ba shemppiw ta gisho gidi dhayssiya oonikka iyo ashshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luuqa 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoha 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asi alame ubbaa haaridi, gidoshin ba shemppiw dhayssiyabaa woykko qohiyabaa gidikko iya ay maaddii? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Oonikka tananinne ta qaalan yeellatikko Asa Na7ay ba bonchchuwara hessadakka aawa bonchchuwaranne Geeshsha kiitanchchota bonchchuwara yaa wode iyan yeellatana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; hayssan eqqidayssata giddofe Xoossaa kawotethaa be7onnashin hayqqonna asati de7oosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa malay laamettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Maato 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi he oda odin, hosppun gallasappe guye, Phexiroosa, Yayqoobanne Yohaannisa baara ekkidi woossanaw deriya bolla keyis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Phexi 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>I woosa bolla de7ishin iya ayfe karey laamettis; afilaykka awa mela phoolidi booxis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nam77u asati, enttika Museranne Eliyaasara bonchchon qonccidi, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yerusalaamen polettanaw de7iyabaa, hessika, I ha alamiyappe shaakettanabaa iyara odettoosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Phexiroosanne iyara de7eyssata dhiskkoy efin, entti dhiskkofe barkkiya wode iya bonchchuwanne iyara eqqida nam77u asata be7idosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Asati Yesuusappe shaakettidi baana hanishin, Phexiroosi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, hayssan gideyssi nuus ay mela lo77o! Issino new, issino Muses, issino Eliyaasas oothidi heedzu shaqara shaqaroos” yaagis. Shin I ay odettidaakko erenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>I yaagidi odettishin shaaray yidi enttana kammis. Entti he shaara giddo gelishe babbidosona. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shaara giddofe, “Ta doorida na7ay hayssa iya si7ite” yaagiya qaalay si7ettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luuqa 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>He qaalay si7ettidaappe guye, Yesuusi barkka de7ishe benttis. He wode entti be7idabaa oodeskka odonna, bantta wozanan oykkidi si7i gidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi tuna ayyaanaa issi na7aappe kessis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Maato 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wonttethe entti deriyappe wodhdhiya wode daro asay yidi iyara gayttidosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>He wode asaa giddofe issi asi, “Asttamaariyaw, ta issi na7aa yada be7arkki. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanay qopponna oykkidi waasises; goppontto yegisidi qakerethees, asatethaa qohidi un77ethidi yeddees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ne tamaareti kessana mela woossas, shin entti dandda7ibookkona” yaagidi woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ammanoy baynna geella yeletethato, awude gakkanaw ta hinttera daane, hinttena dandda7anee? Ne na7aa bada haa ekkaya” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Na7aa ekkidi yaa wode tuna ayyaanay sa7an holi yeggidi kokkorssis. Shin Yesuusi tuna ayyaanaa hanqidi na7aappe kessis. Na7aakka na7aa aawas immis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Asay ubbay Xoossaa gita wolqqan malaalettidosona. Entti I oothidaban malaalettishin, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Hayssa ta hinttew odeyssa loythi si7ite; Asa Na7ay morkketa kushen aadhdhi imettana” yaagis. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Shin I gidabay enttafe geemmida gisho, akeekibookkona. Hessa gisho, zaaridi oychchanaw babbidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaafe gita gidanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Maato 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti, “Nu giddon gita gidanay oonee?” gidi palama oykkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luuqa 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta wozanaa qofaa eridi yooga na7aa ba matan essidi, <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Ha yooga na7aa ta sunthan mokkiya oonikka tana mokkees, tana mokkey tana kiittidayssa mokkees, hintte ubbaafe guuxeyssi, I gita gidana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luuqa 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoha 13:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yohaannisi, “Godaw, issi asi ne sunthan tuna ayyaanata kessishin be7idi I nuura gidonna gisho diggida” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinttera eqettonnayssi, I hintte bagga. Hessa gisho, iya diggofite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Samaare asay Yesuusa ixxidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesuusi salo biya wodey matattida gisho, Yerusalaame baanaw qanxidi denddis. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Samaare biittan de7iya issi gutaa bidi, ubbabaa iyaw giigisana mela ase yaa kiittis. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Shin I bey Yerusalaame gidiya gisho, entti iya mokki ekkibookkona. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti Yayqoobaranne Yohaannisara hessa be7idi, “Godaw, saloppe tami wodhdhidi entta mo gaana mela ne koyay” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Kawo 1:9-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="55" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi guye simmi entta hanqettidi, “Hintte garssan aybi ayyaani de7iyakko hintte erekketa. Asa Na7ay ase ashshanaw yisippe attin dhayssanaassa gidenna” yaagis. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Yaappe denddidi hara guta bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaaloy cigisiya gatiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Maato 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Entti ogiyara bishin, issi asi, “Ne biyaso ubbaa ta kaallana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Workkanatas olli, salo kafotas keethi de7ees, shin Asa Na7ay ba huu7iya shemppisiyasoy baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hankkuwako, “Neeni tana kaalla” yaagis. Shin uray, “Godaw, koyrottada ta aawa moogada yaana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Hayqqidayssati hayqqidayssata moogana mela enttaw aggaaga; neeni bada Xoossaa kawotethaa sabbaka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Qassi hara asi, “Godaw, ta nena kaallana, shin koyrottada ta soo asa sarothada yaana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Kawo 19:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Koxe oykkidi guye xeelliya oonikka Xoossaa kawotethaas bessenna” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi laappun tammanne nam77u tamaareta kiittis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Goday haraa laappun tammanne nam77u <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Laappun tammanne nam77u: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi maxaafati laappun tamma goosona; qassi paydo 17 xeella.</char></note> asata dooris. I baanaw qoppida katamaanne guta ubbaa sinthattidi baanada nam77a nam77a oothidi kiittis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Hekko shiiqana kathay daro shin oosanchchoti guutha. Yaaniya gisho, kathaa goday oosanchchota kiittana mela woossite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Maato 9:37-38</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hiza, biite, dorssatada suudhumeta giddo hinttena taani yeddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Maato 10:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hintte biya ogiyas aykkoka oykkofite, miishe gidin kathi gidin caamma oykkofite. Oge bolla oonakka sarothofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Maato 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luuqa 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hintte gelida keethaa ubbaa koyrottidi, ‘Saroy ha keethaas gido’ yaagite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Saro dosiya asi he bessan de7ikko, hintte saroy yan shemppana; ixxas giikko hintte saroy hinttew simmana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Oosanchchos damooze bessiya gisho, hintte gelida keethan hinttew shiishidayssa ubbaa mishenne uyishe yan gam77ite. Issuwa sooppe issuwa soo yuuyoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Qoro 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:8">1Ximo 5:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ay katamakka hintte geliya wode asay hinttena mokkidi, hinttew shiishidaba ubbaa miite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>He kataman de7iya hargganchchota pathishe, ‘Xoossaa kawotethay hintteko matis’ yaagidi odite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin issi katamaa geliya wode asay hinttena mokkonna ixxiko dabaaba keyidi hayssada giite:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ha@O 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Nu tohuwa bolla de7iya hintte katamaa baana pittoos, shin Xoossaa kawotethay hintteko matattidayssa erite.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Maato 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luuqa 9:3-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pirdda gallasan ha katamaappe Soodome katamaas pirdday kawushshe gidanayssa ta hinttew odays” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Medhe 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Maato 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">11:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Ammanonna gisho borettida katamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Maato 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Yesuusi, “Neno Koraaziine, neno Beetesayda, ayye, hinttenan oosettida malaatati Xiroosaninne Sidoonan oosettidaakko yan de7iya asay kayo ma7o ma77idi, bidintha bolla uttidi beni maarotan geli agganashin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-21">Hiz 26:1-21</ref>; Iyu 3:4-8; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zakka 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hinttefe aathidi Xiroosasinne Sidoonas Xoossaa pirdday kawuyana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nekka Qifirnahoome, salo gakkanaw nena dhoqqu oothanaw koyay? Ne duge Si7oole holettana” yaagis. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Hinttena si7ey tana si7ees, hinttena ekkonnay tana ekkena, tana ekkonnay tana kiittidayssa ekkenna” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luuqa 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoha 13:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Laappun tammanne nam77ati simmidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Laappun tammanne nam77u tamaareti kiitettida bessaafe keehi ufayttishe simmidosona. Yesuusakko shiiqidi, “Godaw, ne sunthan tuna ayyaanatikka nuus kiitettidosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Xalahey saloppe wol77anthada wodhdhishin ta be7as. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hekko, shooshaanne kornne yedhdhana melanne morkkiya wolqqaa zaarana mela maata hinttew immas. Hinttena qohanabay aykkoyka deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:13">Maz 19:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gidoshin, hintte sunthay salo mazggaban xaafettida gisho, ufayttiteppe attin tuna ayyaanati kiitettida gisho ufayttofite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 10 fig*</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba ufayssaa qonccisis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Maato 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi Geeshsha Ayyaanan ufayttidi, “Saluwa sa7aa Godaw, hayssa cinccatappenne eranchchotappe geenthada yalagatas qonccisida gisho galatetta. Ee ta aawaw, hessa ne oothanaw lo77o shene gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ubbabay ta aawappe taw imettis. Na7ay ooneekko aawappe attin hari woykko na7ay qonccisanaw koyeyssafe hari oonikka aawa erey baawa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoha 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Yesuusi dumma ba tamaaretakko, “Hintte be7eyssa be7eyssati anjjettidayssata. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tuma daro nabetinne kawoti hintte be7eyssanne si7eyssa be7anawunne si7anaw amottidosona, shin be7ibookkona, si7ibookkona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuma siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hekko, issi gallas Muse wogaa eriya issi uray denddidi Yesuusa yaagidi paace oysho oychchis. “Asttamaariyaw, merinaa de7uwa laattanaw taani ay ootho?” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Maato 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12:28-34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Muse maxaafan xaafettiday woygii? Ne waata nabbabay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Addey zaaridi, “ ‘Ne Godaa ne Xoossaa, ne kumetha wozanappe, ne kumetha shemppuwafe, ne kumetha wolqqaafenne ne kumetha qofaappe dosa. Qassi ase ne shooruwa ne huu7iyada dosa’ yaagees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Zaare 6:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Neeni likke zaaradasa, nekka hessada ootha. Neeni merinaw de7on daana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shin uray bana xillo oothanaw koyidi, “Hanos I ta shooroy oonee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iya oyshaas Yesuusi yaagidi zaaro immis, “Issi ase de7eyssi Yerusalaame katamaappe duge Iyaarkko katamaa bishin oge bolla panggati keyidi shocidosona. Iya ma7uwa qaari ekkidi hayqoppenne paxappe giddon yeggidi bidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Guyeppe, Ayhude kahine issoy he ogiyara ba buussu bishe uraa be7idi deshshi gidi aadhdhis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Qassi issi Leewe de7eyssi he bessaa gakkishe uraa be7idi harasoora aadhdhidi bis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin, issi Samaare biitta ase de7eyssi he ogiyara yishe uraa be7idi iyaw qadhettis<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2Taari 28:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iyaakko shiiqidi, iya madunthaa bolla zaytenne woyne tigidi qachchis. Ba hariya bolla utisidi imathi aqiya keethi efis. He bessan iyaw koshshiyaba ubbaa oothis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wonttethe nam77u dinaare kessidi imatha keethaawas immidi, ‘Hayyana ha uraa loytha xeella. Taani new immidayssafe bollara ne kessiyabaa ubbaa ta new ciggana’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Hiza, ha heedzu asatappe panggati shocida uraas shoorotey new oona daanii?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Uray zaaridi, “Iyaw qadhettidayssaka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Nekka bada hessada ootha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Marttanne Mayraami son</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretara oge bishe issi guta gakkis. Yan Martta geetettiya issi maccasiya iya ba son mokkasu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38-39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoha 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Iwukka Mayraamo giya michchiya de7awusu, Mayraama qaala si7ashe Godaa tohuwa matan uttasu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin Martta daro ooson un77ettada Yesuusakko shiiqada, “Godaw, ta michchiya oosuwa ta xalaalas yeggada utta aggin ta daaburiya wode neeni be7ashe si7i gay? Iya tana maaddana mela odikkii” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Shin Goday hayssada gidi zaaris, “Martta, Martta, neeni daroban un77ettasaanne metootasa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Gidoshin, koyettey issibaa xalaala. Mayraama lo77o doorasu, hessika iippe ekettenna” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi woosabaa tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Maato 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusi issi bessan woossees. Woosaa wurssida wode iya tamaaretappe issoy, “Godaw, Yohaannisi ba tamaareta woosa tamaarssida mela nekka nuna woosa tamaarssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Hayssada yaagidi woossite:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Saluwan de7iya nu aawaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ne geeshsha sunthay anjjetto;</para>
  <para style="q2">ne kawotethay yo.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu gallasa kathaa hachchi hachchi nuus imma.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nuna qoheyssata nuuni atto geyssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">nu nagara atto ga;</para>
  <para style="q2">paacen nuna gelssofa’ yaagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko yaagis: “Leemisos hinttefe issuwas laggey de7ees. I giddi bilahe ba laggiya soo bidi, ‘Ta laggiyaw, guutha uythi taw immarkki. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Taw lagge gidida issi asi ogeppe yin, iyaw aathiyabaa dhayas’ yaagikko,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Iya laggey keethaa giddon gididi, ‘Hayyana tana waaysoppa, wulay gorddettis. Ta naytikka taara arssa bolla zin77idosona. Yaaniya gisho, denddada ne koyabaa immanaw dandda7ikke’ yaagiyye? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; laggetethaa gisho denddidi immanaw koyonna ixxikokka woosan salethida gisho denddidi koshshiyaba ubbaa immees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, taani hinttew odays: woossite hinttew imettana; koyite hintte demmana; kare yidi xeegite hinttew dooyettana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gaasoykka woossiya ubbay ekkees; koyey demmees; kare yidi xeegeyssas dooyettees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, aawato hintte giddofe na7i uythi woossin shuchchu immey oonee? Molo woossin shooshi immey oonee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Woykko phuuphphulle woossiko kornne immi? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hintte iitata gidishe hintte naytas lo77obaa immo erikko, salon de7iya hintte aaway woosseyssatas Geeshsha Ayyaana waati aathi immenne?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Bi7elzebuula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusi doona muumisida tuna ayyaanaa issi uraappe kessis. Tuna ayyaanay keyida mela muume uray odettis. Asaykka malaalettis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin issoti issoti, “Tuna ayyaanaa halaqaa, Bi7elzebuula wolqqan tuna ayyaanata kessees” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Harati qassi paaces saloppe malla bessana mela koyidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Maato 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi entta qofaa eridi enttako, “Woli giddon shaakettiya kawotethi ubbay dhayees; woli giddon shaakettiya keethi kunddees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xalahey woli giddon shaakettiko iya kawotethay waanidi minnidi eqqanee? Hintte tana, ‘I tuna ayyaanata Bi7elzebuula wolqqan kessasa’ yaageta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, taani tuna ayyaanaa Bi7elzebuula wolqqan kessiyabaa gidikko hintte nayti oode wolqqan kessonashsha? Hessa gisho, entti hintte bolla pirddeyssata gidana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin taani tuna ayyaanati Xoossaa biradhdhen kessiyabaa gidikko hiza Xoossaa kawotethay hintteko matidayssa erite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mino asi danccettidi ba keethaa naagiyabaa gidikko, iya shaloy boshettenna. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hanoshin, iyappe aadhdhi mino gidida asi yidi, iya qohidi xoonikko ammanettidi danccida danccuwa bilisidi, iya shaluwa bonqqidi haraas shaakkees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Taara gidonnayssi tana ixxees; taara shiishonnaysika laallees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Tuna ayyaanay asappe keyida wode shemppiyaso koyidi haathi baynnasoora yuuyees. Shemppiyaso dhayida wode, ‘Ta keyidasuwa simmana’ yaagees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>I simmiya wode keethay pitettidi lo77idi de7ishin demmis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, bidi iyappe aadhdhidi iitida haraa laappun tuna ayyaanata ekkidi yees. Iyan gelidi duussu oykkees. He uraas koyroyssafe guyeyssi aadhdhidi iita gidees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa oda bolla de7ishin issi maccasi asaa gaathafe denddada, ba qaala dhoqqu oothada, “Nena tookkida uloynne neeni dhammida dhanthati anjjettidosona” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin I, “Anjjettidayssati Xoossaa qaala si7idi kiitetteyssata” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yoonasa malla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Daro asay shiiqida wode Yesuusi, “Ha yeletethay iita; ooratha malla koyees. Shin Yoonasa malaatappe attin hari enttaw imettena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Maato 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yoonasi Nanawe asaas malla gidida mela Asa Na7aykka ha yeletethaas malla gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Yoha 3:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Dugeha kawiya pirdda gallas ha yeletethaara denddada pirddana. Gaasoykka, iya Solomone cinccatethaa si7anaw biitta gaxappe denddada yasu. Hekko Solomoneppe aadhdheyssi hayssan de7ees<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Kawo 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Taari 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nanawe asati pirdda gallas ha yeletethaara denddidi entta bolla pirddana. Gaasoykka Yoonasa sibkkatiyan maarota gelidosona. Hekko, Yoonasappe aadhdhey hayssan de7ees” yaagis. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Yoha 3:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Asatethaa poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Xomppe xomppidi qosa bessan woykko oto giddon wothiya asi deenna. Asi poo7uwa be7ana mela dhoqqa bessan wothees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Maato 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luuqa 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ne asatethaas poo7oy ne ayfiyaa. Ne ayfey lo77o gidikko, ne kumetha asatethay poo7ees. Nena ayfey sakkiko ne asatethay ubbay dhumees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ne garssan de7iya poo7oy dhumonna mela naageeta. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hiza, ne kumetha asatethay poo7o gidikko, ne asatethankka hari dhuma bessi dhayikko, ne asatetha kumethay wolile poo7o mela gidees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Usuppun ayyeta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Maato 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba oda onggida mela issi Farisaawey baara kathi maana xeegis. I iyara issife gelidi gibira bolla uttis. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Farisaawey Yesuusi kathi maanappe sinthe kushe meecconayssa be7idi malaalettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Goday iyaakko, “Hintte Farisaaweti quuliyanne shaatiya bolla bagga meecetta. Shin hintte gaathay uuzetethaninne iitatethan kumis. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, eeyato, bolla medhdhidayssi gaatha medhdhiday iya gidenneyye? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Shin quuliyaninne shaatiyan de7eyssa manqotas immite. He wode hinttew ubbabay geeshshi gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Farisaaweto hinttena ayye, sawoppe, xalooteppe, hessa melabaappe asraata kesseta. Shin xillotethinne Xoossaa dosoy hinttenan baawa. Harata aggonna hayssatakka oothanaw bessees, shin aggideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Leewe 27:30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Farisaaweto hinttena ayye, Ayhude Woosa Keethan bonchcho oyde, giya giddon bonchcho sarotho doseeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Malay dhayin asay eronna bollara biya duufo daaneyssato hinttena ayye” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Higge asttamaarey zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, ne hessa gashe nuna cayaasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Hinttenoo, higge asttamaareto, hinttenakka ayye, asay tookkanaw dandda7onna deexo tooho toosseeta, shin hinttee hintte huu7es hari attoshin biradhdhe xeerankka bochcheketa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Hintte aawati wodhida nabeta duufuwa hintte giigisiya gisho hinttena ayye. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte aawata oosuwa minthanaw entti wodhida nabeta duufuwa hintte loythiya gisho, entta iita oosuwas hintte markka. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay ba cinccatethan, ‘Nabetanne hawaareta ta hinttew kiittana, shin hintte baggata wodhana; harata gooddana’ yaagis. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha yeletethay alamey medhettoosappe hanno gakkanaw gukkida nabeta ubbaa suuthas oyshettana. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Aabelappe doomidi yarshsho bessaasinne Xoossa Keethaafe gidduwan gukkida Zakkariyaasa suutha gisho ha yeletethay oyshettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2Taari 24:20-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Higge asttamaareto, hinttena ayye, eratetha qulppiya hintte kushen oykkideta, shin hinttew gelekketa haratakka gelsseketa.” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe baanaw keyaa wode higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti iyara eqettidi oyshon waaysosona. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Iya doonappe keyaa qaalan iya oykkanaw koyidi hessa oothidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ayyaana minthetho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Maato 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode daro mukulun taybettiya asay woli bolla yedhdhettana gakkanaw asi asa bolla shiiqidi de7ishin, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Farisaaweta irshshuwaafe naagettite. Hessika entta cubbotethaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Maato 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar 8:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qoncconna qosettidi, erettonna geemmidi attiyaabay aykkoyka baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luuqa 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte dhuman odidabay ubbay poo7on si7ettana, qol77a gaathan kalkkashidabay dabaaban odettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ta baggatoo ta odeyssa si7ite; ashuwa wodhoosonappe attin haraa aykkoka oothanaw dandda7onnayssatas babbofite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hanoshin, hintte babbanaw besseyssa ta hinttew qonccisana. Hessika wodhidaappe guye Gaannamen yegganaw wolqqay de7eyssas iyaw babbite. Ee, tuma gays; iyaw babbite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ichchashu buubbeti issi santimes bayzettokonaayye? Hanoppe attin enttafe issinnaka Xoossaa sinthan dogetuku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, hintte huu7e binaanaykka paydettidi de7ees. Hiza, babbofite daro buubbetappe hintte aadhdheeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ta odeyssa si7ite; asa sinthan taw markkattiya ubbaas Asa Na7ay Xoossaa kiitanchchota sinthan markkattana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asa sinthan tana kaddeyssas Xoossaa kiitanchchota sinthan ta iya kaddana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Asa Na7a bolla kadhe qaala haasayiya ubbay maarota demmana, shin Geeshsha Ayyaana bolla kadhe qaala odetteyssi maaretenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Maato 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar 3:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Asi hinttena oykkidi Ayhude Woosa Keethan, daynnata sinthaninne kawota sinthan gooshechchiya wode ay odaneekkonne woygi zaaraneekko hirggofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Maato 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Luuqa 21:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>He wode hintte odanabaa Geeshsha Ayyaanay hinttena tamaarssana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Dure uraa eeyatethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Asaa giddofe issi asi Yesuusakko yidi, “Ta ishay taw nu aawa laatappe shaakkana mela iyaw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “La addiyaw, hintte bolla tana daynnanne laata shaakkiya cima oothiday oonee?” yaagis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi, “Asa de7oy shalo darotethan gidonna gisho yaare aggidi minthidi hinttena naagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kaallidikka leemison, “Gadey daro kathi immiya issi dure uray de7ees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He uray, ‘Ta kathaa taani shiishanaw bessi guuxida gisho ay ootho?’ yaagidi ba wozanan qoppis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hizappe yaatana; kase de7iya shaaleta laallada haraa dalgga shaaleta keexana. Kathaanne taw de7iyaba ubbaa iyan yeggana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ba shemppeeko, ‘Ta shemppete, daro laythas new gidiya shalo shiishas. Hiza, shemppada ma, uya, ufaytta’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Shin Xoossay, ‘La, eeya addiyaw, hachchi qamma ne shemppiya neeppe ekettawusu. Hiza, ne shiishidabay oodees gidanee?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, baw duretethi sa7an shiishiya asi, Xoossaa matan dure gidonna asaas wurssethay ha urayssa mela” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Un77ettofite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Maato 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Hiza, ta odiyabaa si7ite, hintte shemppuwas ay mino hintte bollaas ay ma77ino yaagidi un77ettofite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shemppoy kathafe bolli afilappe aadhdhees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kafota be7ite zerokkona, kiishokkona, eleykka shaaleykka baawa. Shin Xoossay enttana muzees. Hintte kafotappe daro aadhdheeta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hanoshin, hinttefe un77ettidi ba laythaa bolla issi qamma gujjanaw dandda7ey oonee? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hiza, ha guuthabaa oothanaw dandda7onna hintte harabaas ays un77etteetii? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ane cishshati waanidi dicciyakko be7ite. Waayokkonanne suqqokona. Hari attoshin, Solomoney ba de7iya bonchcho ubban enttafe issuwa melakka ma77ibeena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Kawo 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Taari 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, ammanoy paccidayssato, hiza, Xoossay hachchi benttidi wontto taman yegettana cishshata hayssada mayzikko, hinttena waati aathi mayzennee? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ay mino woykko ay uyino gidi un77ettofite. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He ubbaas Xoossaa ammanonna asati un77ettoosona. Shin hintte aaway Xoossay hessi ubbay hinttew koshsheyssa erees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ubbaafe aathidi Xoossaa kawotethaa koyite hessi ubbay hinttew gujji imettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, guutha deretoo, yayyofite; hintte aawa Xoossay kawotethaa hinttew immanaw ufayttees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hinttew de7iyabaa bayzidi manqotas immite. Kaysoy ekkonnason, bili moonnason, cimonna karxiitan, wuronna shaluwa saluwan shiishite. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hintte wozanay hintte shaloy de7iyasuwan gidana.</para>
  <para style="s">Barkkidi naago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Qanthan danccidi giigettite; hintte xomppey poo7idayssa gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Maato 25:1-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bantta goday yaaganoppe simmana gakkanaw barkkidi naageyssatada, goday yidi xeegiya wode ellesidi dooyanaw giigida asata daanite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar 13:34-36</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bantta goday simmiya wode dhiskkonna de7ishe naageyssati anjjettidayssata. Tuma gays; goday qanthan danccidi gayta yuushuwan utisidi mokkees. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Goday laade gidin giddi bilahe gidin woykko wonttimaathe gidin yidi, hessa mela dhiskkonna naagishin demmiya he aylleti anjjettidayssata. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin hayssa erite kaysoy awude yaanekko keethaaway eriyakko keethay boketiya wode si7i gidi be7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:23-44">Maato 24:23-44</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hintteka giigidi naagite; Asa Na7ay hintte qopponna wode yaana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Phexiroosikka, “Godaw ha leemisuwa nu xalaalas odayye woykko asa ubbaasee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Goday zaaridi, “Hiza, kathaa muzanaw bessiya wodiyan immana mela goday ba aylleta bolla shuumida ammantheysinne wozanaama halaqay oonee? <verse number="43" style="v"/>Goday simmiya wode hessa mela oothishe benttiya aylley I anjjettidayssa <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; ba godaas de7iya shalo ubbaa bolla I shuumettana. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Shin he aylley, ‘Ta goday elle yeenna’ yaagidi ba wozanan qoppidi, macca aylletanne adde aylleta wadhdhiko, qassi baw koyida mela mishenne uyishe mathottiko, <verse number="46" style="v"/>he aylliya goday I qopponna gallasaninne hirggonna wode yaana. Yidi iya qanxerethidi, iya qaada ammanonna asatara oothana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Godaa sheniyada giigonnayssinne iya goday ay dosiyakko erishe oothonna aylley daro garaafettana. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Shin ba godaa sheniya eronna attidi garaafettanaw besseyssa oothiday guuthara garaafettana. Gaasoykka daro imettidayssafe daro koyettees, daro hadara ekkidayssafekka daro immana gidi naagettees.</para>
  <para style="s">Sarotethas gidonnashin shaaketethassa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Maato 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Taani yiday biitta bolla tama oythanaassa. Ha77i tamay oykkiyako tana waati ufayssanddeshsha! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Hanoshin, ta ha77i xammaqettiya xinqqatey de7ees. I polettana gakkanaw ta daro un77ettays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar 10:38</ref></char></note> <verse number="51" style="v"/>Sa7a bolla sarotethi ehanaw yida hinttew daanii? Gidenna, ta yiday shaakkanaassa. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ha77ife doomidi woli giddon shaakettida ichchashu keethaa asati issife de7oosona. Nam77ati heedzata bolla, heedzatikka nam77ata bolla, denddidi shaakettoosona. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Aaway na7aa bolla, na7aykka aawa bolla, aayiya na7ee bolla, na7iya aaye bolla, azinaa aayiya na7aa machche bolla, na7aa machchiya azinaa aaye bolla, denddidi shaakettana.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Laythata malo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Maato 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Qassika asaakko, “Wuloha baggara saloy shaaratiya wode be7idi, ellesidi, ‘Iri yaana’ yaageta, hessadakka hanees. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Dugeha carkkoy carkkiya wode ‘Sa7ay awana’ yaageta, hessadakka hanees” yaagis. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, cubboto, Salobaanne sa7abaa shaakki ereetashin ha wodiya shaakki eroy hinttena waanidi xoonidee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Yaatin, hintte huu7es ays tuma pirddeketii? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ne morkkiyara wolla daynna sinthan eqqanaw bashe oge bolla giiganaw koya. Ne giigonna ixxiko gooshechchidi daynna sinthi nena efana. Daynnay nena polisees aathi immana. I nena woynen yeggana. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Si7ite, issi bakkani attonna cigga onggana gakkanaw ne yaappe keyonnayssa era” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nagarappe simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusakko asay yidi Philaaxoosi wodhidi entta suuthaara entta yarshshuwa walakkida Galiila asaabaa odida asati he bessan de7oosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>I hayssada yaagidi zaaris; “Yaatin he Galiila asati he iita hayqo hayqqida gisho, Galiilan de7iya asa ubbaafe aadhdhida nagaranchcho daanoona? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gidenna! Gidoshin, hintteka maarotan simmona ixxiko, ubbay hessada dhayana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Woykko qassi Salihoome giya bessan gimbbey woddidi wodhida tammanne hosppun asay Yerusalaamen de7iya asa ubbaafe aadhdhida nagaranchcho daanoona? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gidenna! Shin hintteka maarotan simmona ixxiko ubbay hessada dhayana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi hayssada gidi leemiso odis; “Issi uraas woyne gaden tokettida balase mithiya de7awusu. I iippe ayfe koyii yidi aykkoka demmibeenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gadiya goday woyne oosanchchuwakko, ‘Ayfe demmanaw koyada heedzu laythi simerettada aykkoka demmabiikke. Hessa gisho, qanxa digga; ays biittaa melisay?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Shin oosanchchoy, ‘Godaw, I yuushuwa oothada osha yeggana gakkanaw ha laythas aggarkii. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha laythi ayfikko lo77o, ixxiko qanxa agga’ ” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="s">Zokko kuunida maccasiya paxasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi Sambbaata gallas Ayhude Woosa Keethan tamaarssees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>He bessan tammanne hosppun laythi tuna ayyaani zokko kuunisida issi maccasiya de7awusu. Iya kuunappe denddoyssan suure eqqanaw dandda7ukku. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyo be7ida wode xeegidi, “Ha maccasete, ne harggiyafe paxadasa” yaagis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ba kushiya I bolla wothin, iya sohuwara suurada eqqasu. Xoossaaka galatasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqay yilotidi asaakko, “Oosoy oosettiya usuppun gallasati de7oosona. Hessa gisho, he gallasatan yidi paxiteppe attin Sambbaata gallas gidenna” yaagis. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kessa 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Zaare 5:13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Goday, “Cubboto, hintte giddofe boori woykko hare Sambbaata gallas zadalope billidi haathe ushshanaw efonnay oonee? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaatin, ha maccasiya Abrahaame na7aa gidashe xalahen qashettada tammanne hosppun laythi kumethi de7idaaris Sambbaata gallas birshshetethi koshshennee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>I hessa odida wode eqetteyssati ubbay yeellatidosona. Shin asay ubbay I oothida malaalisiya ooso ubban ufayttidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi hayssada yaagis, “Xoossaa kawotethay ay daanii? Iya aybira daaniso? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Xoossaa kawotethay issi asi ba goshshan tokkida wola ayfe mela. I diccidi mithi gidis. Salo kafoti iya tashiya bolla shemppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qassi, “Xoossaa kawotethaa aybira daaniso? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Issi maccasiya daro dhiillera walakkada munuqida guutha irshsho daanees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Xuuntha wulaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Yerusalaame bishe I kanthiya ogiyan de7iya katamataninne gutatan tamaarssishe aadhdhis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Issi asi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, attanay guutha asa xalaalee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi enttako, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Si7ite, xuuntha wulaara gelanaw baaxetite. Daroti gelanaw koyoosona shin enttaw hanenna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Keethaaway denddidi wulaa gorddidaappe guye, ‘Nuus dooyarkii’ yaagishe karen eqqidi xeessi oykkeeta. Shin I, ‘Hintte ooneekkonne awuppe yidaakko ta erikke’ gidi zaarana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode hintte, ‘Neera wolla mida, uyida, nu dabaabankka tamaarssadasa’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“I zaaridi, ‘Hintte ooneekkonne awuppe yidaakko erikke. Hinttenoo, geellato taappe haakkite’ yaagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Abrahaame, Yisaaqa, Yayqoobanne nabeta ubbaa Xoossaa kawotethan be7ana, shin hintte karen wodhdhidi attiyaa wode hinttew yeehonne achche garccethi gidana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Asay dolohappe, wulohappe, pudehappenne dugehappe yidi Xoossaa kawotethan gibira bolla uttana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Maato 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha77i dethan guye gididayssatappe sinthe gidanayssati, sinthe gididayssatappe guye gidanayssati de7oosona” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Maato 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10:31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Yerusalaames yeekkis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Maato 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>He wode Farisaawetappe issoti issoti yidi, “Heroodisi nena wodhanaw koyaa gisho ha bessafe denddada ba gidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Bidi, he workkanaas hekko, ‘Hachchinne wontto tuna ayyaanata kessana, hargganchchota pathana, heedzantho gallasan kuushsha bolla gakkana’ yaagis giite. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hanoppe attin, nabey Yerusalaameppe karen hayqqanaw bessenna. Hessa gisho, hachchi, wonttonne wontti fee7in he bessaa baanaw denddas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabeta wodhiyare, neekko kiitettidayssata shuchchan caddiyare, kuttoy ba nayta ba qefiyappe garssan shiishiyada ne nayta ta qesiyappe garssan aappun toho shiishanaw koyadina, shin hintte ixxas gideta. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; hintte keethay kaysattana. Godaa sunthan yeyssi anjjettidayssa hintte gaana gakkanaw tana demmeketa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Er 22:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Farisaawiya son</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi Sambbaata gallas Yesuusi issi Farisaaweta halaqaa soo kathi maanaw geliya wode asay caddi xeellosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He bessan shawuhe harggen waayettiya issi asi iyaw sintha baggara zin77is. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi Farisaawetakkonne higge asttamaaretakko, “Sambbaata gallas hargganchcho pasoy wogeyye woga gidennee?” yaagidi oychchis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti si7i gidosona. Yesuusi harggettiya uraa bochchi pathidi moyzis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Qassika hinttefe issuwas na7i woykko boori Sambbaata gallas aafon wulliko ellesidi kessonnay oonee?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Maato 12:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti issibaakka zaaranaw dandda7ibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi imatuwas xeegettidayssati bonchcho bessi doorishin be7idi, ha leemisuwa odis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Issi asi nena yaagano xeegikko bonchcho bessan uttofa. Neeppe aadhdhi bonchchettiya asi xeegettanaw dandda7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Leemi 25:6-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hinttena nam77atakka xeegidayssi yidi, ‘Ne bessaa ha imathaas yedda’ yaagiya wode neeni yeellatashe ziqqa bessi wodhdhaasa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gidoshin, ne xeegettida wode koyrottada ziqqa bessi be7ada utta. Xeegoyssi yidi, ‘Ta laggiyaw, ha bonchcho bessan utta’ yaagana. He wode neera issife xeegettida asa ubbaa sinthan ne bonchchettana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bana dhoqqu dhoqqu oothiya ubbay kawuyana; bana ziqqi ziqqi oothiya ubbay dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Maato 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luuqa 18:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi iya mokkida keethaa aawakko, “Quma woykko kaho imato xeegiya wode, neeni kushe zaaro xeegonna mela ne laggeta woykko ne ishata woykko ne dabbota woykko ne dure shoorota imato xeegoppa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gidoshin, ne imato giigisida wode manqota, wobbeta, gunddatanne qooqeta xeega; neeni anjjettana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hayssati kushe zaaranaw dandda7onna gisho kushe zaaroy geeshshata denddo gallasan new simmana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Gita imatuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Maato 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusara wolla imato bolla uttoyssata giddofe issoy hessa si7idi, “Xoossaa kawotethan imato bolla utteyssi anjjettidayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Issi asi gita imato giigisidi daro asata xeegis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Imatoy mokettiya saatey gakkiya wode xeegettida imathata, ‘Hekko ubbabay giigis, haa yiite’ yaagidi xeeganaada ba aylliya kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Shin ubbayka bantta gaaso gaaso medhdhidosona. Issoy, ‘Ha77i buroo gade shammida gisho, bada be7anaw koshshees hayyana tana aggarkii yaaga’ yaagis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hankkoy, ‘Ichchashu waatha boori shammas enttana waaxa be7ana gisho hayyana tana lanccofa’ yaagis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qassi haray, ‘Taani buroo meddan de7iya gisho, yaanaw dandda7ikke’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Aylley simmi yidi he ubbaa ba godaas odis. He wode yaagano aaway hanqettidi aylliyako, ‘Ellesada kataman de7iya wogga ogetanne daggalata bada, manqota, wobbeta, qooqetanne gunddata haa eha’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Aylley, ‘Ta godaw, ne kiittidayssi ubbay polettis, shin ha77ika bessi de7ees’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Goday aylliyako, ‘Horogata bollanne, gade giddo ogeta keya, ta keethay kumana gakkanaw demmida ubbaa yaana mela ootha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; imatotidayssatappe oonikka ta gibiraappe moonnayssa erite’ gis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Godaa kaaloy yarshshisees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Daro asay iyara wolla bishin Yesuusi enttako guye simmidi, <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Taakko yaa ubbay ba aawanne, ba aayiw, ba machchiwunne ba nayta, ba ishatanne ba michcheta, hari attoshin ba de7uwa ixxonnay ta tamaare gidanaw dandda7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Maato 10:37</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ba masqaliya tookkidi tana kaallonnay ta tamaare gidanaw dandda7enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:13">Maato 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luuqa 9:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Hinttefe issi asi shuchcha keethi keexanaw koykko, keethaa keexidi ongganaw ay mela miishe koshshiyako koyrottidi eranaw qoppi be7onnay oonee? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gidonna ixxiko, ha uray baaso shuchchu hiixin qusttethi xoonikko, <verse number="30" style="v"/>be7iya ubbay, ‘Ha uray gimbbethi oykkin qusttanaw iya xoonis’ yaagidi boroosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Woykko issi kawoy hara kawora olettanaw denddishe laatamu mukulu olanchchota ekki yaa kawuwara tammu mukulu olanchchotara eqettanaw dandda7anayssanne dandda7onayssa uttidi zorettonnay oonee? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Eqettanaw dandda7ettonaba gidikko, he hara kawuwara haahon de7ishin giiganaw koyrottidi cima yeddidi oychchees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessadakka, hinttefe oonikka baw de7iyaba ubbaa aggonna ixxiko ta tamaare gidanaw dandda7enna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Maxiney lo77o, shin maxiney ba mal7uwa aggiko, waanidi maxine geetettanaw dandda7ii? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Biittatethaaskka araddatethaaskka maaddonabaa gidiya gisho wora yegettees. Hiza, si7iya haythi de7iya asi si7o” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Dhayida dorssaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Maato 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi gallas qaraxa qanxeyssatinne nagaranchchoti Yesuusa timirttiya si7anaw iya yuushuwan shiiqidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luuqa 5:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti, “Hayssi uray nagaranchchota shiishidi ekkees, enttara issife mees” yaagidi zuuzummidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaagidi hayssa leemiso enttaw odis; <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Hintte giddofe issuwas xeetu dorssati de7iyabaa gidikko enttafe issoy dhayikko uddufun tammanne uddufunata bazzon aggidi dhayoyssa demmana gakkanaw koyonnay oonee? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Demmida wode ufayttidi ba gannan tookkidi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ba soo simmees. Ba laggettanne shoorota issife xeegidi, ‘Dhayida ta dorssaa demmas, taara issife ufayttite’ yaagees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessadakka, maaroti koshshonna uddufun tammanne uddufun xillotappe aathidi maarotan geliya issi nagaranchchuwa gaason salon gita ufayssi gidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Woykko tammu biri de7iya issi maccasiya tammaafe issiya dhayikko demmana gakkanaw xomppe oythada keethaa pittada mintha koyonnara oonee? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Demmida wode ba laggettanne ba shoorota xeegada ‘Dhayida ta issi bira demmida gisho taara wolla ufayttite’ yaagawusu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Si7ite, hessa mela issi maarotethan geliya nagaranchchuwan Xoossaa kiitanchchota sinthan ufayssi gidees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Dhayida na7aa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Zaaridi Yesuusi, “Issi uraas nam77u nayti de7oosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Enttafe kaalo na7ay ba aawakko, ‘Ta aawaw, ne shaluwappe ta gishuwa taw imma’ yaagis. Aaway ba shaluwa ba naytas shaakkis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Guutha gallasappe guye kaalo na7ay ba gishuwa ubbaa qachchi ekkidi haaho biitta bis. Yan alttacan shaluwa toochchidi onggis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I baw de7iyaba ubbaa wurssidaappe guye he biitta ubban mino koshi keyin metootis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he biittaa asaappe issuwa soo gaata gelis. Uray iya guduntho heemmana mela ba moothaa yeddis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gudunthoti miya harquwafe maanaw amottis, shin iyokka iyaw immiya asi benttibeenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wozani simmin, ‘Aappun ta aawa aylletas kathi wora wodhdhin ta hayssan koshara hayqqanaw gakkadina?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Denddada ta aawakko bada, ‘Ta aawaw, salon Xoossaa, sa7an nena qohas. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hizappe ne na7a geetettada xeegettanaw taw bessonna gisho, ne son de7iya aylletappe issuwada tana payda’ yaagana” yaagis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, denddidi ba aawakko bis.</para>
  <para style="p">“Hanoshin, I buroo haahon de7ishin aaway qadhettidi, iyaakko woxxi bidi idimmidi yeeris. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na7aykka, ‘Ta aawaw salon Xoossaa, sa7an nena ta qohas. Hizappe ne na7a geetettada xeegettanaw bessike’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Iya aaway aylleta xeegidi, ‘Ellesidi ubbaafe lo77o gidida ma7o ehidi iya mayzite; iya biradhdhen sagaayo, iya tohuwan caamma aathite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Modhdho gatarmentho ehidi shukkite, moos, ufayttoos. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta na7ay hayssi hayqqis, shin ha77i paxis; dhays, shin benttis’ yaagis. Hessafe guye, ufayetethi oykkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“He wode bayra na7ay goshsha gaden de7ees. Yaappe yishe soo matishin yethinne gufa girssi si7is. <verse number="26" style="v"/>I, aylletappe issuwa xeegidi haniyabay aybeekko eranaw oychchis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Aylley, ‘Ne ishay saro yida gisho ne aaway modhdho gatarmentho iyaw shukkis’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Bayra ishay yilotidi soo gelanawukka koyibeenna. Aaway kare keyidi soo gelana mela iya woossis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shin I ba aawakko, ‘Hekko, hayssa mela laythi ta new aylletada ne kiitaappe issuwaka pacisonna new kiitettin ta ta laggetara ufayttana mela hari attoshin issi laaqa deeshe immabaakka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hanoshin, hayssi ne na7ay ne shaluwa laymatara doomisidi yin modhdho gatarmentho shukkadasa’ ” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Aawaykka, ‘Ta na7aw, neeni ubba wode taara de7aasa, tabay ubbay neessa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hayssi ne ishay hayqqis, shin paxis; dhays, shin benttis. Hessa gisho, daro ufayttanaw bessees’ yaagana” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ammanettonna shuumaa leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Issi dure uraas iyappe garssara issi shuumay de7ees. He shuumay ba godaa shaluwa toochchees yaagiya worey keethaawa gakkis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Keethaaway shuumaa xeegisidi, ‘Taani woygiyabaa si7adinaa? Hizappe neeni ta keethas shuuma gidada oothanaw dandda7onna gisho ta shaluwa taw sheedhdha’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“He shuumaykka ba wozanan hayssada yaagidi qoppis. ‘Ta goday tana shuumatethaafe wothana hanees, goya aqanaw wolqqi baawa, woossa maanaw yeellayees; yaatin ta waano? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shuumatethaafe ta wodhdhiya wode asay tana mokkana mela oothanabaa ta erays’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, iya godaa acoy de7iya asaa issuwa issuwa xeegi ehidi koyro uraakko, ‘Ne bolla ta godaa acoy ay meli de7ii?’ yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“I, ‘Laatamu barmeele zayte acoy de7ees’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">“Shuumay, ‘Wule warqattiya he7e, ellesada, tammu barmeele zayte acoy de7ees gada xaafa’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Hessafe kaallidi nam77anthuwako, ‘New aappuni de7ii?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">“I, ‘370 kunttaale gistte acoy de7ees’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">“Shuumay, “Ne wule warqattiya he7e, ellesada, 296 kunttaale yaagada xaafa’ yaagis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Keethaaway ammanettiboonna shuumaa iya bilaamatethaas nashshis. Ha alamiya nayti ase oythan poo7o naytappe aadhdhida wozanaamata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, ta hinttew odays; ha alamiya miishey wuriya wode merinaa keethan mokettana mela ha miishiyara hinttew laggeta shammite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ubbaafe guuthaban ammanettiday daroban ammanettidayssa gidees. Qassi ubbaafe guuthaban ammanettonnayssi daroban ammanettenna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, ha alamiya miishen hintte ammanettonna ixxiko tuma miishe hinttew ooni hadara immanee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte hara asa miishen ammanettonna ixxiko, hintte buzo miishe hinttew ooni immanee?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Issi aylley nam77u godatas haarettanaw dandda7enna. Issuwa ixxiko hankkuwa dosees woykko issuwako shiiqikko hankkuwa kadhees. Hessadakka, hintte Xoossasinne miishes haarettanaw dandda7ekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Maato 6:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Miishe dosiya Farisaaweti hessa si7ida wode Yesuusa qelqisidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>I, hinttee hinttena asa sinthan xilliseeta, shin Xoossay hintte wozanaa erees. Asa sinthan bonchchettidayssi Xoossaa sinthan borettidayssa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Muse higgeynne nabeta kiitay Yohaannisa gakkanaw hinttew odettishe gam77is. Hessafe guye, Xoossaa kawotethaa Wonggelaa odettishe gam77is. Asi ubbay yaa gelanaw dafettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Maato 11:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Gidoshin, higgiyafe issi laafa pidaaley attanaappe saloynne sa7ay aadhdheyssi kawuyees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Maato 5:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ba machchiw yeddidi haraa ekkiya ubbay laammees. Ba azinaappe anjjettidaaro ekkeysika laammees” yaagis. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Maato 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Qoro 7:10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Dure uraanne Alaazara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Al77onne alleeqo afila ma77iya, sa7i injjetin gallas gallas ufayssan de7iya issi dure asi de7ees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hari qassi asatethay kumethi madunxida issi Alaazara geetettiya manqoy he dure uraa karen yegeti attidayssi de7ees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Koshappe denddoyssan dure uraa gaytappe wodhdhiya tiifiya maanaw amottishe de7ees. Hari attoshin, kanati yidi iya madunthaa laaccosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“He manqoyka hayqqis; kiitanchchoti iya Abrahaame ki7uwa efidosona. Qassi dure uraykka hayqqidi moogettis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Si7oolen un77ettidi de7ishe dhoqqu gidi haahon Abrahamenne iya ki7on de7iya Alaazara be7is. <verse number="24" style="v"/>I, ‘Aawaw Abrahaame, taw qadhettarkii; ha laco taman un77ettada de7iya gisho Alaazari ba biradhdhiya haathan yeddidi ta inxarssa laakothana mela hayyana iya yeddarkki’ yaagidi waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Shin Abrahamey iyaakko, ‘Ta na7aw, ne sa7an de7iya wode lo77obaata ekkidayssa, qassi Alaazari iitabata ekkidayssa akeeka. Shin ha77i I hayssan ufayttees, qassi neeni waayettashe de7aasa’ yaagis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ha ubbaafe aadhdhidi, ‘Haappe hintteko, hinippe haa nuukko aadhdhanaw koyeyssati pinnonna mela nuusinne hinttes giddon gita aafoy de7ees’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Dure uray, ‘Aawaw, yaakko Alaazara ta aawa soo kiittana mela ta nena woossays. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Taw ichchashu ishati de7idosona, enttika ha waaye bessaa yoonna mela enttaw bidi markkatto’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Shin Abrahamey, ‘Enttaw Museranne nabetara de7oosona; entti odiyabaa si7onna’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Dure uray, ‘Aawaw Abrahaame, hessatho gidenna; issi asi hayqoppe denddidi biikko entti maarotan gelana’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Abrahamey, ‘Musenne nabeta si7onna ixxiko, hari attoshin hayqoppe issi asi denddi odikkoka ammanokkona’ yaagis.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Oyshisiya aawatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Ase dhubethidi nagaran gelssiyabay yoonna aggenna. Gidoshin, nagaran gelana mela oothiya uraa ayye” yaagis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He uray kaalotappe issuwa balethanaappe woxa ba qoodhen qachchidi abban wulliko iyaw lo77o. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Maato 18:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="rem">fig 11 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">“Ne ishay nagara oothiko hanqetta; qiirottidi maarotethan simmiko, iyaw atto yaaga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi gallasan laappun toho qohidi, laappun toho, ‘Taani ta balaa eras tana maara’ yaagidi neekko yiikko iyaw atto ga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hawaareti Godaakko, “Ammano nuus gujjarkkii” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Goday, “Gaashe ayfe mela ammanoy hinttew de7ikko ‘Hayssa wolaa shodettada abbaa giddon toketta’ yaagikko hinttew kiitettana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gujjidikka Yesuusi, “Hintte giddofe issuwas goshshanchchoy woykko dorsse heemmiya aylley de7ikko ooso gadeppe woykko wudeppe soo simmiya wode, ‘Elle haayada kathi maanaw utta’ yaagey de7ii? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Deenna, ‘Taw kaho giigisa; taani mada, uyada aggana gakkanaw eqqada muza. Hessafe guye, neeni qassi maasanne uyaasa’ yaagenneyye? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hiza, goday, aylley kiitaa polida gisho anjjiyye? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintteka kiitettoyssa ubbaa polida wode, ‘Nu pathonna aylleta; oothanaw bessiya oosuwa polida’ yaagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Baro harggiyafe geeyida tammu asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yerusalaame bishe Samaarisinne Galiila biittaas giddora kanthidi aadhdhis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Issi gutaa geliya wode baro harggen oykettida tammu asati iya demmidosona. Enttika haahon eqqidi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Godaa Yesuusa, nuus qadhettarkii” yaagidi waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>I entta be7ida wode, “Bidi hinttenatethaa Ayhude kahine bessite” yaagis. Entti ogiya bolla bishe paxidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Leewe 14:1-32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Enttafe issoy ba paxuwa be7ida wode dhoqqu gida qaalan Xoossaa bonchchishe Yesuusakko simmis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>I Samaare biitta asi, shin Yesuusa tohuwa bolla gufannidi iya galatis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Paxiday tammu asata gidokkonaayye? Yaatin, uddufunati aw bidonaa? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ha allaga uraappe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ha allaga uraappe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baro harggiyafe paxida uray allaga geetettiday I Ayhude gidonna gishossa.</char></note> attin hari simmidi Xoossaa galatey deenna guusseyye?” yaagidi oychchis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uraakko, “Ne ammanoy nena pathis denddada ba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa kawotethaa yuussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Maato 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Farisaaweti, “Xoossaa kawotethay awude yaanee?” gidi Yesuusa oychchidosona. I, “Xoossaa kawotethay benttiya mallan yeenna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Qassika iyo, ‘Hannina woykko hinina yaaganaw dandda7enna. Ays giikko, Xoossaa kawotethay hintte giddon de7ees’ ” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Asa Na7aa gallasatappe issuwa be7anaw hintte amottiya wodey yaana, shin hintte be7ekketa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asay, ‘I yan de7ees’ woykko, ‘Hayssan de7ees’ yaagana, shin enttana kaallidi booppite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wol77anthi wol77ammidi saluwa gaxappe gaxa poo7isiya mela Asa Na7aa yuussaa gallasay hessada hanana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin hessi hananaappe sinthe Asa Na7ay daro waayanawunne ha yeletethan ixettanaw bessees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nohe wode hanidayssa mela Asa Na7aa wodiyankka hessada hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Medhe 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nohey Markkabiyan gelida qammaa gakkanaw asay mishenne uyishe, ekkishenne gelishe de7ishin bashsha haathay yidi ubbaa dhayssis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Medhe 7:6-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Looxe laythankka hessatho hanis. Asay mishenne uyishe, shammishenne bayzishe, tokkishenne keexishe, gam77idosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Medhe 18:20-19:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Looxey Soodomeppe keyida gallas diinne geetettiya xuuggiyabay saloppe bukkidi ubbaa dhayssis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay qoncciya wodekka hessada hanana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“He gallasan oonikka karen de7ey keethaa giddon de7iyabaa ekkanaw soo geloppo. Hessadakka, gaden de7iya asi aykkoskka soo simmofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Maato 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mar 13:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Looxe machchiw akeekite; <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Medhe 19:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v"/>ba shemppiw ashshanaw koyaa asi oonikka dhayssana; ba shemppiw aathi immiya oonikka I ashshana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luuqa 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoha 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; he gallasan nam77u asati issi arssan zin77ana. Issoy ekettana, hankkoy attana. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nam77u maccasati wolla gaaccishin issiya ekettana, hankkiya attana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nam77u asati wolla gaden goyeyssatappe issoy ekettana, hankkoy attana” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi maxaafatan paydo 36 deenna.</char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Entti, “Godaw aw ekettanee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">I, “Hayqqidabay de7iya bessan ankoti shiiqoosona” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Minnidi woossana mela tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaareta azalonna ubba wode woossana mela tamaarssanaw koyidi yaagidi leemiso odis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Issi kataman Xoossaas yashettonna asaskka yeellatonna issi daynni de7ees <verse number="3" style="v"/>He kataman issi am77iya da7awusu. Iyakka, ‘Tawunne ta morkkiyas giddon de7iya mootuwa pirdda’ yaagada ubba wode he daynnaako simerettawusu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Daynnay guutha wodes I odaa si7onna ixxis, shin guyeppe ba wozanan, ‘Taani Xoossaas yayyonna, asas yeellatonna ixxikokka, <verse number="5" style="v"/>ha am77iya tana waaysiya gisho iw pirddana; yaatonna ixxiko ubba wode yada tana salethana’ yaagidi qoppis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Godaykka, “Geella daynnay gidayssa si7ideta <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay qammanne gallas iyaakko waassiya ba dooridayssatas pirddeneyye? Enttana maaddanaw gam77iyye? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odeyssa si7ite, ellesidi pirddana. Gidoshin, Asa Na7ay yaa wode sa7a bolla ammano demmanddeshsha?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Farisaawiyanne qaraxa qanxiseyssa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassi zaaridi, Yesuusi, banttana xillo asada oothidi ceeqetteyssatasinne harata kadheyssatas hayssada yaagidi leemiso odis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Nam77u asati woossanaw Xoossa Keethi bidosona. Issoy Farisaawe hankkoy qassi qaraxa qanxisiya asi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Farisaawey eqqidi baw woossishe, ‘Xoossaw taani harata mela bonqanchcho, geellanne laymatiya asi, aadhdhida qassi ha qaraxa qanxisiya uraa mela gidonna gisho nena galatays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Saaminttafe nam77u toho xoomays, ta demmiyaba ubbaafe asiraata kessays’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Shin qaraxa qanxiseyssi qassi haahon eqqidi hari attoshin salo dhoqqu gidi xeellanawukka yayyidi ba tiraa iccishe ‘Xoossaw, tana nagaranchchuwa maararkii’ gidi woossis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odeyssa si7ite; Farisaawiyappe hayssi qaraxa qanxiseyssi Xoossaa sinthan xillo gididi ba soo simmis. Ays giikko, bana dhoqqu dhoqqu oothiya asi kawuyana, bana kawushshiya asi dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Maato 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luuqa 14:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne yooga nayta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-30">Maato 19:13-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-31">Mar 10:13-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi yooga nayta bolla ba kushiya wothidi anjjana mela asay iyaakko ehoosona. Yesuusa tamaareti hessa be7idi ays Yesuusakko eheeti yaagidi kaccidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi nayta baakko xeegidi, “Yooga nayti taakko yaanayssa diggofite; yo giite. Ays giikko, Xoossaa kawotethay enttada hanidayssatassa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; Xoossaa kawotethaa yooga naytatho ekkonnay oonikka yaa gelenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Dure uraa oyshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Maato 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ayhude halaqatappe issoy, “Keeha asttamaariyaw, merinaa de7uwa demmanaw ay ootho?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Ays tana keehaw yaagada xeegay? Issi Xoossaafe attin hari keehi baawa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Laammofa, wodhoppa, kaysotoppa, worddo markkattofa, ne aawanne ne aayiw bonchcha yaagiya kiitaa eray” yaagidi oychchis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kessa 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Zaare 5:16-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Uraykka, “Hessata ubbaa taani na7atethafe doomada naagashe gam77as” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa si7ida wode, “Hiza, new issibay paccees; new de7iyaba ubbaa bayzada manqotas imma; salon nena shaloy naagees. Yaata simmada tana kaalla” yaagis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin uray hessa si7ida wode iyaw daro shaloy de7iya gisho daro qiirottis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusi uraa be7idi, “Dure asas Xoossaa kawotethaa geloy waanidi un77anddeshsha? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Durey Xoossaa kawotethaa gelanayssafe gimaley narppe luhora kantheyssi kawuyees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa si7ida asay, “Hessa gidikko ooni attanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Asas dandda7ettonabay Xoossaas dandda7ettees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Phexiroosi, “Hekko nuuni nubaa ubbaa aggidi nena kaallida” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Yesuusi tuma ta hinttew odays; Xoossaa kawotethaas gidi ba keethaa woykko ba machchiw woykko ba ishata woykko ba aawanne ba aayiw woykko ba nayta aggiday; <verse number="30" style="v"/>ha wodiyan dakko daro, yaana alamiyan merinaa de7uwa ekkonnay oonikka baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba hayquwaaba zaari odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Maato 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesuusi tammanne nam77ata baakko xeegidi, “Ane Yerusalaame boos, nabeti Asa Na7aabaa xaafidaba ubbay yan polettana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>I Ayhude gidonna asaas aadhdhidi imettana. Entti iya toochchana, cayananne iya bolla cuttana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iya garaafidaappe guye, wodhana, shin heedzantho gallasan I hayqoppe denddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin iya tamaareti hessa ubbaafe issibaakka akeekibookkona. Iya xuuray enttaw qosettida gisho I woygidaakko eribookkona.</para>
  <para style="s">Qooqe uray xeellis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Maato 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi Iyaarkko matattiya wode issi qooqe uray oge gaxan uttidi woossees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qooqe uray asay he bessaara aadhdhishin si7idi, “I aybe?” gidi oychchis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Entti, “Naazirete Yesuusi hayssara aadhdhees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>I, “Dawite na7aw, Yesuusa, tana maararkii” yaagidi waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Sinthe sinthe biya asati, “Si7i ga” gidi hanqettidosona. Shin I, “Dawite na7aw, tana maara” yaagidi darssi waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesuusi eqqidi uraa baakko ehana mela kiittis. Uraykka, iyaakko shiiqin, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Ta new ay oothana mela koyay?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Qooqey, “Godaw ta xeellanaw koyays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Xeella, ne ammanoy nena pathis” yaagis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Uray sohuwara xeelli aggis. Xoossaa bonchchishe Yesuusa kaallis. Asa ubbay hessa be7idi Xoossaa galatidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Qaraxa qanxisiya Zakkiyoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi Iyaarkko gelidi aadhdhees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan Zakkiyoosa geetettiya qaraxa qanxiseyssata halaqay de7ees. I daro dure. <verse number="3" style="v"/>I Yesuusi ooneekko be7anaw koyis. I qanthi gidiya gisho asaa darotethaafe denddoyssan Yesuusa be7anaw dandda7ibeenna. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusa be7anaw koyidi I biya ogiyas sinthe woxxi bidi issi boobba mitha bolla keyis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi he bessaa gakkishe dhoqqu gidi be7idi, “Zakkiyoosa, hachchi ta ne son pee7anaw bessiya gisho elle wodhdha” yaagis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>I ellesi wodhdhidi ufayssan Yesuusa mokkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>He bessan de7iya asaa ubbay hessa be7idi, “Nagaranchchuwa soo gelidi mokettanw hanees” yaagidi zuuzummidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gidoshin, Zakkiyoosi eqqidi Godaakko, “Godaw, hekko taw de7iya shalo ubbaafe baggaa manqotas immana. Asappe aybaakka worddon balethada ekkidabaa gidikko oyddu kushe zaarana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi qassi, “Ha uray Abrahaame na7a gidida gisho hachchi atotethay ha soo yis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay yiday dhayidayssa koyanasaanne ashshanaassa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Maato 18:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Tammu minaaneta leemisuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asay hessa si7iya wode, Yesuusi Yerusalaame matattida gishonne Xoossaa kawotethay ha77i matara qonccana daanida gisho enttaw leemiso odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato 25:14-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi, “Issi gita asi de7eyssi baw kawotethi ekkidi yaanaw hara biitta bis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iyaw oothiya aylletappe tammata xeegidi issuwas issuwas tammu minaane <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">minaane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">minaaney Girike doona. Issi minaaney issi gallasa oosanchchos heedzu ageena damooze gidees.</char></note> immidi ‘Ta simmada yaana gakkanaw ha miishiyara zal77ite’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“He biittaa asay iya ixxiya gisho, ha uray nu bolla kawotana mela nu koyokko yaagidi ase iya guyera kiittidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Gidoshin, he uray kawo gididi ba biittaa simmis. He tammu aylleti I immida miishiyan ay mela zal77idi wodhisidaakko eranaw koyidi enttana xeegisis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Koyroyssi yidi, ‘Godaw, ne taw immida miishey haraa tamma wodhdhis’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Iya Goday, ‘Neno ammanettida aylliyaw lo77o oothadasa. Neeni guuthaban ammanettida gisho new tammu katamata bolla maata immas’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nam77anthoyka yidi, ‘Godaw, ne taw immida miishey haraa ichchasha wodhdhis’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Goday iyaakko, ‘Newukka qassi ichchashu katamata bolla maata immas’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Hekko heedzanthoy yidi, ‘Godaw, ta curqqan xaaxada naagida ne miishiya hannashu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ays giikko, neeni nebaa gidonnabaa ekkeyssanne ne zeronnabaa buucciya iita asi gidiya gisho new yayyas’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Iya goday zaaridi, ‘Neno iita aylliyaw ne doonatho ta nena pirddana. Ta wothonnabaa ekkeyssanne zeronnabaa buucciya asi gideyssa ne erikko, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ta yada ta miishiya wodhera ekkana mela zal77iya asaas ays immabiikkii?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Iya goday he bessan eqqidayssatakko, ‘Iyara de7iya miishiya ekkidi tamma wodhisidayssas immite’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Entti, ‘Godaw, iyaw kasekka tammu minaaney de7ees’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Goday, ta hinttew odays; ‘De7iya ubbaas hari guzhettana, shin baynnayssafe haray atto iyaw de7iyarakka ekettana. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Maato 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luuqa 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gidoshin, ta entta bolla kawotonna mela koyidayssata he ta morkketa ha ta sinthe ehidi goyrite’ gis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Maato 25:14-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi gita bonchchon Yerusalaame gelis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maato 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odidayssafe guye enttafe sinthe aadhdhi hamuttidi Yerusalaame bis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shamaho Deriya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shamaho Deriya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shamahoy daro doliya Dere guussu.</char></note> bolla de7iya Beetefaagenne Bitaaniya matattida wode ba tamaaretappe nam77ata yaagidi kiittis: <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Hintte sinthan de7iya gutaa biite, hintte yaa gakkiya wode oonikka toggonna qashettada de7iya hare mari demmana. Iya billidi haa ekki yiite. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Oonikka, ‘Ays billeeti?’ gidi oychchiko, ‘Goday iya koyees’ yaagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kiitettidayssati bidi I gidayssada hanin be7idosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Entti hare maraa billishin godati be7idi, “Hare maraa ays billeeti?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Goday iya koyees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yaappe hare maraa Yesuusakko ehidosona. Bantta ma7uwa hare maraa zokkon yeggidi Yesuusa hare maraa bolla utisidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asaykka I biya ogiya bolla bantta ma7uwa hiixidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shamaho Deriya dugethaa wodhisiya ogiyakko matiya wode, taybon keehi daro asay entti be7ida malaalisiyaban ufayttidi bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Godaa sunthan yaa kawoy anjjettidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2">saluwan saroy</para>
  <para style="q2">ubbaafe dhoqqa saluwan bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossaas gido.”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi Xoossaa galatidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz 118:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Asaa giddofe issi issi Farisaaweti Yesuusakko, “Asttamaariyaw, ne tamaareta hayzite gada hanqetta” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>I enttako, “Entti si7i giikko shuchchati waassana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yerusalaame matishe katamaa be7idi iyaw yeekkis. <verse number="42" style="v"/>“New saro gidanayssa hachchi ne eridabaa gidiyakkoshin, ha77i ne ayfiyaappe geemmis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ne morkketi ne yuushuwa diridi dumma dumma ogiyara nena teqqidi un77ethiya wodey yaana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nenanne ne dirssaa garssan de7iya ne nayta dhayssana. Issi issi shuchchu denthidi laallana, ays giikko Xoossay nena ashshanaw yaa wodiya erabaakka” yaagidi iw yeekkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi gelidi zal77eyssata yaappe goodis. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Qassi, “‘Ta keethay Xoossaa woossiya keethi gidana’ gidi xaafettis, shin hintte ta keethaa panggata gonggolo oothideta” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Er 7:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Gallas gallas Xoossa Keethan tamaarssees. Kahineta halaqati, higge asttamaaretinne deriya cimati iya wodhanaw oge koyoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luuqa 21:37</ref></char></note> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Gidoshin, asay ubbay iya timirttiya bantta wozana yeggidi si7iya gisho, enttaw oothanabay dhays.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa maatay Ayhudetas oysho gidis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Maato 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi gallas Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan asaa tamaarssishininne Wonggelaa markkattishin, kahine halaqati, higge asttamaaretinne deriya cimati issife iyaakko yidi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Neeni hayssata aybi maatan oothiyako nuus oda. Ha maata new immiday oonee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>I enttako, “Takka hinttena issibaa oychchana, ane taw zaarite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisa xinqqatey Xoossafeyye asappe?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti woli giddon yaagidi zorettidosona: “Xoossafe giikko yaatin, ays ammanibeekketii?” yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Asappe giikko, asay ubbay Yohaannisi nabe gideyssa ammaniyaa gisho nuna shuchchan caddana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaaniya gisho, “Awuppeeko nu erokko” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hiza, takka ay maatan hayssata oothiyako hinttew odikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Goshshanchchota leemisuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Maato 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ha leemisuwa asaas yaagidi odis; “Issi asi woyne turaa tokkis. Goshshanchchotas kera immidi daro wode gam77idi yaanaw hara biitta bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Woyne ayfiyaa maxiya wodey gakkin woyniya ayfiyaappe iyaw yeddana mela goshshanchchotakko ba aylliya kiittis. Shin goshshanchchoti he aylliya oykkidi wadhdhidi mela kushe yeddidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kaallidikka hara aylliya kiittis. Qassi goshshanchchoti iya wadhdhidi, kawushshidi mela kushe yedidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ha77ika zaaridi heedzantho aylliya kiittis. Goshshanchchoti iyakka madunxisidi woyniya turaa giddofe gaxa kessidi yeggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Woyniya goday, ‘Yaatin ta ay ootho? Ane qassi ta dosiya ta na7aa yeddana; ooni eri entti iya bonchchonna aggokona’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Shin goshshanchchoti uraa na7aa be7ida wode, ‘Hayssi iya laatteyssa, haa yiite iya wodhana, yaatikko laatay nuus gidana’ yaagidi zorettidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Woyniya giddofe gaxa kessidi wodhidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">“Yaatin, woyniya goday he asata waatanee? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yidi he goshshanchchota dhayssana, woyniya bessaa hara asatas immana. Asay hessa si7ida wode ‘Shinchchalle hessa melabaa ehoppo’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta caddi xeellidi,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Yaatin ‘Gimbbe keexiya asati borida shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2">keethaas malanne minotethi immiya ubbaafe aadhdhiya shuchchi gidis’</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettidayssa birshshethay aybe?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz 118:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>He shuchchaa bolla kunddiya ubbay qoxettana, shuchchay iya bolla wodhdhiya ubbay liiqana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretinne kahine halaqati ha leemisoy odettiday entta bolla gideyssa eridi he wode iya oykkanaw koyidosona, shin asaas babbidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Giirabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Maato 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusa deriya haariya Roome kawuwa maatas aathi immanaw koyidi iya doonappe bala qaala naagoosona. Hessa polisanaw xillo daanidi cimmiya asata iyaakko kiittidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kiitettidi bida asati, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni odeysinne tamaarsseyssi likke gideyssa, qassi Xoossaa ogiya tumatethan tamaarsseyssanne oonakka shaakkonnayssa nu eroos. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hanoshin, Roome kawuwas giira giiranaw bessi bessennee?” yaagidi iya oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin I entta wozanaa iitatethaa erida gisho, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ane tana issi santime bessite, Iya bolla de7iya misileynne sunthay oodebaye?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Roome Kawuwa Qeesareyssa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Yaatikko, Qeesareyssa Qeesares, Xoossayssa Xoossaas immite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, I zaarida zaaruwan asaa sinthan bala demmanaw dandda7ibookkona. Iya zaaruwan malaalettidi si7i gidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqoppe denddobaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Maato 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hayqoppe denddoy baawa yaagiya Saduqaawetappe issoti issoti Yesuusakko yidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Ha@O 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Asttamaariyaw, issi asi machcho ekkidi na7a yelonna hayqqiko, iya ishay he maccasiw ekkidi nayta yelidi ba ishaas zerethi ashshana mela Musey xaafis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Zaare 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hekko laappun ishati de7oosona. Koyroyssi machcho ekkidi na7a yelonna hayqqis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nam77anthoy iyo ekkidi na7a yelonna hayqqis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Heedzanthoyka hessatho hanis. Laappunati ubbay hessada hanidi iyo ekkidosona, shin na7a yelonna hayqqidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wurssethan maccasiya hayqqasu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hiza, laappun addey iyo ekkida gisho hayqoppe denddiya wode iya oode machcho gidanee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Asay ha wodiyan ekkoosonanne geloosona. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shin hayqoppe denddidi yaana alamiyan daanaw besseyssati ekkokonanne gelokkona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Entti kiitanchcho mela gidiya gisho sinthafe hayqqokona. Hayqoppe denddida gisho entti Xoossaa nayta. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Musey Godaa, ‘Abrahaame Godaa, Yisaaqa Godaa, Yayqooba Godaa’ gidi tushiya giddon xuugettiya tama taarikiya xaafidayssan hayqqida asay denddeyssa bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kessa 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ubbay iyaw de7on de7eyssata gidiya gisho I de7on de7eyssata Godaappe attin hayqqidayssata Goda gidenna” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretappe issoti issoti, “Asttamaariyaw, lo77obaa odadasa” yaagidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, hara oysho oychchanaw yayyidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosi oode na7ee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Maato 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iyappe kaallidi Yesuusi enttako, “Asay Kiristtoosa waattidi Dawite na7a yaagonaa? <verse number="42-43" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Dawitey ba huu7en ba maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Xoossay ta Godaakko</para>
  <para style="q">ta ne morkketa</para>
  <para style="q2">ne tohoy yedhdhiyaso oothana gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">taappe ushachchan baggan utta’ gis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Hiza, Dawitey Kiristtoosa, ‘Godaa gidi xeegishe iyaw na7a waanidi gidi?’ ” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Derey ubbay si7ishin ba tamaaretakko, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Adussa ma7o ma77idi yuushshe doseyssatappe, giyan bonchcho sarotho, Ayhude Woosa Keethan bonchcho oyde, mokettiya sonkka bonchcho bessi koyaa higge asttamaaretappe naagettite. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Entti am77eta keethaa kalloyoosona, xillo asi daanidi woosa adussoosona. Hessati ubbaafe aadhdhiya iita pirdda ekkana” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Am77ee muxaata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Dure asay Xoossa Keethan muxaata saaxiniyan yeggishin Yesuusi dhoqqu gidi asaa be7is. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qassi issi manqo am77iya nam77u sikkina yeggishin be7idi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Ta hinttew tuma odays; ha manqo am77iya ubbaafe aathada immasu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ha asa ubbay banttaw de7iyabaappe immidosona, shin iya ba pacciyaafe, baw de7iya aquwaa ubbaa immasu” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha wodiya malaatata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Maato 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-23">Mar 13:3-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaaretappe issoti issoti Xoossa Keethay daro lo77iya shuchchaninne asay Xoossaas immida imotan lo77idayssa odettoosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Ha hintte be7iyabay ubbay laalettonna, shuchchi shuchcha bolla gimbbettida mela attonna wodey yaana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Enttika, “Asttamaariyaw, ha ubbay hananay awude? Qassi hayssi hananayssas malaatay aybee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaagidi enttaw zaaro immis; “Balettonna mela naagettite. Daroti, ‘Taani Kiristtoosa, wodey matattis’ yaagishe ta sunthan yaana, shin hintte entta kaallofite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hintte olabaanne asaa geellatethaa si7iya wode dagammofite. Hessi sinthattidi hananayssi attonnabaa gidiya gisho wodiya wurssethay ellesidi yeenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, “Derey deriya bolla, kawotethay kawotethaa bolla denddana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gita biitta qaaxoy hanana, koshaynne gadoy dumma dumma bessan darana, yashshiyabaynne gita malaatati saloppe qonccana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin ha ubbay hananaappe sinthe ta sunthaa gisho gidi asay hinttena gooddananne oykkana. Ayhude Woosa Keethaninne qasho keethan hinttena yeggana. Kawota sinthenne deriya haareyssata sinthe hinttena efana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessika tabaa hintte enttaw markkattanaw lo77o oge gidana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte oyshettiya wode woygidi zaaro immanee gidi hintte wozanan un77ettonna mela akeekite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luuqa 12:11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ays giikko, hintte morkketi hinttera eqettanawunne palamanaw dandda7onna doonanne cinccatethi ta hinttew immana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, hinttena yelidayssati, hintte ishati, hintte dabbotinne laggeti hinttena aathi immana. Hintte giddofe issota issota wodhana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta sunthaa gisho asa ubbaa sinthan hintte ixettidayssata gidana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin hari attoshin, hintte binaanappe issoykka dhayenna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Polo dandda7an hintte, hintte shemppuwa ashshana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Yerusalaame katamay wotaaddaren direttidi uttidashin hintte be7ikko iyaw dhayoy matattidayssa erite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode Yihudan de7iya ubbay deriyakko baqato, kataman de7eyssati yaappe keyo, gaxariyan de7eyssati katama geloppo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ha xaafettidabay polettana mela hessi Xoossay kushe zaariya wode.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hose 9:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Sa7a bolla gita metoy yaana, hessankka asaa bolla Xoossaa hanqoy yaana. Hessa gisho, qanthatidayssatanne dhantheyssata ayye. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Entti mashshan hayqqana, asay ubbay allaga biitta di7ettana. Ayhude gidonna asaa wodey polettana gakkanaw Yerusalaamey enttanan yedhettidayssa gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Awan, ageenaninne, xoolintuwa bolla malaatati hanidi benttana. Abbaafenne zuliya deshuwappe denddoyssan biittan de7iya asay un77ettananne yarkkana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hiz 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:31">Er 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Yo@Qo 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Saluwa wolqqati buqettana gisho asay yashshaninne biitta bolla aybi hananddeshsha gidi naagon banttana balettana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>He wode Asa Na7ay wolqqaninne gita bonchchuwan shaarara yishin entti be7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daane 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Yo@Qo 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hintte atotethay matattida gisho ha hanoti poletethi oykkiya wode giigeti eqqite, hintte huu7iya dhoqqu oothidi xeellite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, hayssada gidi leemiso odis; “Balase giya mithaanne hara mithata ubbaa be7ite. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entti aaciya wode torchchey matattidayssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessada ha hanoti polettishin hintte be7ikko Xoossaa kawotethay matattidayssa erite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Ta hinttew tuma odays; ha ubbay polettana gakkanaw ha yeletethay aadhdhenna. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Saloynne sa7ay aadhdhana, shin ta qaalay aadhdhenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Hiza, dhassi baynna de7on, ushsha daroninne duussabaas un77etethan hintte wozanay oykettonna melanne he qammay akeekonna xiheda hintte bolla gakkonna mela naagettite. <verse number="35" style="v"/>He qammay biitta kumethan de7iya ubbaa bolla gakkana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, yaa iitaappe attanawunne Asa Na7a sinthan eqqanaw dandda7ana mela ubba wode minnidi woossite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gallas gallas Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan tamaarssishe, qamma qamma Shamaho Deriya bolla keyidi aqees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luuqa 19:47</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Asay ubbay iya si7anaw wontta guura iyaakko Xoossaa Keethi yoosona.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yihudi Yesuusa aathi immanaw maqettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maato 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode ‘Faasikka’ yaagiya Uytha Baaley matis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Kessa 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne higge asttamaareti asaas yayyiya gisho, waattidi Yesuusa bantta giddofe dhayssaneekko oge koyoosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xalahey tammanne nam77atappe issuwa gidida Asqoroota Yihuda geetetteyssa gido gelis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yihudi kahine halaqatakkonne Xoossa Keetha naageyssata halaqatakko bidi Yesuusa waati aathi immaneekko enttara maqettis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Enttika hessan ufayttidi miishe immanaw iyara zorettidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ikka zoretethan giigis. Aathi enttaw immanaw asi baynna injje wode naagishe de7ees.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha kahuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Maato 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Faasikka dorssay shukettiya Uytha Baaley gakkis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Faasikka kahuwa maana mela bidi nuus giigisite” yaagidi Phexiroosanne Yohaannisa kiittis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Entti, “Nu awun giigisana mela ne koyay” yaagidi oychchidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>I enttako, “Hekko hintte katama gelishin haatha oto tookkida addey hinttera gayttana. I bidi geliya keethaa iya kaallidi gelite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Keethaawakko asttamaarey, ‘Ta ta tamaaretara wolla Faasikka kahuwa maanaw imatha keethi awunee? yaagis’ giite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>I pooqiya bolla hiixettidi giigidi de7iya dalgga kifile hinttena bessana, yan giigisite” yaagis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti bidi Yesuusi gidayssada hanin demmidosona. Faasikka baale kahuwa yan giigisidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Saateykka gakkida wode Yesuusi hawaaretara wolla kahuwa bolla uttis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>I enttako, “Ta waaye ekkanaappe sinthe ha kahuwa hinttera maanaw daro amottas. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hiza, si7ite! Xoossaa kawotethan hayssas birshshethay polettana gakkanaw ha kahuwa zaarada miikke” yaagis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ushshaa ekkidi galati simmidi, “He7ite hayssa hintte giddon shaakettite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Si7ite! Xoossaa kawotethay yaana gakkanaw hachchife doomada ha woyne ushshaafe zaarada uyikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uythaa ekkidi, galati simmidi, “Hayssi hinttew imettiya ta ashuwa. Hayssa oothishe tana qoppite” yaagidi meenthidi enttaw immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessadakka, kahuwappe guye, ushshaa ekkidi, “Ha ushshay hinttew gukkida ta suuthan gidiya ooratha caaquwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Er 31:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gidoshin, tana aathi immana uraa kushey taara issife gaytana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay iyaw geetettoyssa mela hayqqanaw de7ees, shin iya aathi immiya uraa ayye” yaagis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti bantta giddon, “Hayssa ooni oothanee” gidi woli oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassi entta giddon ooni aadhanee giya palami medhettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Maato 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luuqa 9:46</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Deriya kawoti bantta asaa wolqqan haarosonanne; bantta deriya bolla godateyssataskka banttana, ‘Lo77o ootheyssata’ yaagidi xeegosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Maato 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar 10:42-44</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin hintte giddon hessa mela gidoppo. Hintte giddon bayratey kaaloda hano;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Maato 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref></char></note> kaaletheyssi kaalleyssada hano. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hanoshin, mokkeyssafenne Moketteyssafe awussi aadhdhi? Moketteyssa gidenneyye? Shin taani hintte giddon mokkeyssa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Yo@Qo 13:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Hintteka ta metuwan taappe shaakettonna taara minnidi eqqidayssata. <verse number="29-30" style="v"/>Hintte ta gaytappe maana mela, uyana melanne araatata bolla uttidi tammanne nam77u Isra7eele sheeshata bolla pirddana mela ta aaway tana shuumidayssada takka hinttena ta kawotethan shuumana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Maato 19:28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kaallidikka Yesuusi, “Simoona, Simoona, Xalahey hinttena gistteda harqanaw woossis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shin taani ne ammanoy dhayonna mela new gaannatas. Nekka simmida wode ne ishata mintha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Simooni, “Godaw, taani neera qashettanawunne hayqqanaw giigettas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Ta new odays; hachchi kuttoy waassanaappe sinthe ne tana heedzu toho kaddana” yaagis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttena korojjoy, karxiiteynne caammi baynna kiittida wode hinttew paccidabay de7ii?” yaagidi oychchis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Maato 10:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mar 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luuqa 9:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Aykkoyka paccibeenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>I enttako, “Ha77i korojjoynne karxiitey de7ey oykko; bisoy baynnay ba afilaa bayzidi biso shammo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Haa si7ite! ‘Geellatara taybettis’ geetettidi xaafettidayssi tanan polettanaw bessees. Ee, ta gisho xaafettidabay poletteyssi tumattis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti, “Godaw hayssan nam77u bisoti de7oosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">I, “Gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Shamaho Deriya bolla woossis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Maato 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesuusi kase meezetidayssada denddidi Shamaho Deriya bolla keyis. Iya tamaareti iya kaallidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>He bessaa gakkida wode, “Paacen gelonna mela woossite” yaagis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Enttafe shuchchi holin gakkiya soo mela haakkidi gulbbatidi woossis. <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Ta aawaw, ne shene gidikko ha metuwa taappe aatha. Shin ta shene gidoppo ne sheney hano” yaagidi woossis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy saloppe qonccidi minthis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Daro un77ettidi minnidi woossees. Iya cawaykka suuthi xokkiyada sa7an xokkees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesuusi woosaa wurssidi ba tamaaretakko yis. Entti, azzaniyappe denddoyssan daaburidi dhiskkidashin demmidi, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Ays dhiskkeetii? Paacen gelonna mela denddidi woossite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi oykettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maato 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoha 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>I buroo oda bolla de7ishin daro asati yidosona. Tammanne nam77atappe issoy Yihuda geetetteyssi enttana kaalethees. I Yesuusa yeeranaw mati shiiqis. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Yihuda, Asa Na7aa yeerada aatha immanee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti he hanuwa be7idi, “Godaw bison shocino?” yaagidosona. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Entta giddofe issoy kahine halaqaa oosanchchuwa shocidi ushachcha haytha qanxidi yeggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Agga! Diggofite” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Agga! Diggofite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusi ha bessan agga yaagiday iya ashshanaw gidi asati uraa haytha qanxoyssa agga qanxofa gidayssanne, harati iya oykkanaw yidayssata diggofite ha77i entta wode yaagidayssa nam77u qofata woli gathidi oykkis.</char></note> yaagis. Uraa haythaa bochchidi pathis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi bana oykkanaw yida kahine halaqatakko, Xoossa Keetha naageyssata shuumatakkonne cimatakko, “Paanno oykkiya asada mashshenne xam77a oykkidi yidetii? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ubba gallas Xoossa Keethan ta hinttera de7iya wode ta bolla kushe wothibeeketa. Shin hayssi dhuma kawotethay haarida wodenne hintte wode” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luuqa 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusa kaddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Maato 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:67-75">67-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoha 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusa oykkidi kahine halaqaa zabbaa efidosona. Phexiroosi haahon Yesuusa kaallees. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Asati kahine halaqaa zabban tama eethidi wolla uttidashin Phexiroosi enttara issife uttis. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Issi aylliya Phexiroosi tama matan uttidayssa cadda xeellada, “Ha uray iyara de7ees” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, “Ha maccasete ta he uraa erikke” yaagidi kaddis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Guutha wodeppe guye issi hara addey iya be7idi, “Nekka enttafe issuwa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin Phexiroosi, “Ha addiyaw tana gidikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Issi saate mela gam77idaappe guye issi hara addey tillisidi, “Ha uray Galiilappe gidiya gisho sidhey baynna iyara de7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, “Ha addiyaw, ne geyssa ta erikke” yaagis. I he oda onggonna de7ishin kuttoy waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Goday guye simmidi Phexiroosa xeellis. Phexiroosi, “Hachchi kuttoy waassanaappe sinthe ne tana heedzu toho kaddana” yaagidi, Goday odida qaala akeekis. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Phexiroosi kare keyidi daro kokkoridi yeekkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Yesuusa naagiya asati iya leqisonne deshethi oykkidosona. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Iya ayfiyaa goozidi “Ane tinbbite oda; nena dechchiday oonee?” yaagidi oychchosona. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Hara daro cashshe cayidi kawushshosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Philaaxoosa sinthenne Heroodisa sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Maato 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoha 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Sa7i wonttiya wode Ayhude biitta cimati, kahine halaqatinne higge asttamaareti shiiqidi, Yesuusa bantta sinthe shiishidosona. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Entti, “Neeni Kiristtoosee? Ane nuus oda?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 12 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Ta odiyakko ammanekketa. <verse number="68" style="v"/>Ta oychchiyako zaarekketa. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Shin Asa Na7ay hayssafe gede baggan wolqqaama Xoossaa ushachcha baggan uttana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>He wode ubbay, “Yaatin, neeni Xoossaa na7ee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">I, “Ta Xoossaa na7a gideyssa hintte gideta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Entti, “Hiza, hara markka ay koshshii? I ba inxarssan odishin nu si7ida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Philaaxoosa sinthan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoha 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He bessan shiiqida shanggoti ubbay denddidi Yesuusa Philaaxoosakko efidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ha uray nu asaa balethishin, kawuwas giira giironna mela diggishininne qassi, ‘Taani Kiristtoosa hintte kawuwa’ yaagishin demmida” yaagidi mootidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi Yesuusa, “Neeni Ayhudeta kawoyye?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Ee, ne gidayssa mela” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi kahine halaqatakkonne asaakko, “Ha uraa bolla taani issi balakka demmabiikke” yaagis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin entti, “Ha uray Galiilappe doomidi hayssa gakkanaw Yihuda kumethaa iitabaas denthethees” yaagidi minthi odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi hessa si7ida wode Yesuusi Galiila aseekko eranaw koyidi iya oychchis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi Heroodisa biittaafe yida asi gideyssa Philaaxoosi erida wode Heroodisi he wode Yerusalaamen de7iya gisho iyaakko yeddis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heroodisi Yesuusa be7anaw daro wodeppe koyishe de7iya gisho, iya be7ida wode daro ufayttis. Ays giikko, iyabaa si7ida gisho malaalisiyabaa oothin be7anaw amottishe de7ees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Heroodisi Yesuusa daro oyshota oychchis, shin I aykkoka zaaribeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kahineta halaqatinne higge asttamaareti yan eqqidi minthidi iya mootosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Herodisaranne iya wotaaddaretara Yesuusa kadhidosonanne leqisidosona. Bonchcho afilaa mayzidi Philaaxoosakko zaaridi yeddidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Herodisaranne Philaaxoosara kase morkkeshin he gallas wolla giigidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi kahine halaqata, asaa haareyssatanne asaa xeegidi, <verse number="14" style="v"/>“ ‘Ha uray asaa geellatethas denthethees’ gidi taakko ehideta. Takka hintte sinthan pilggada hintte shiishida mootuwas aybi balakka demmabiikke. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Heroodisi, hessatho aybi balakka iya bolla demmiboonna gisho nuukko yeddis. Tumakka ha uray hayqos gathiya aybi balakka oothibeenna. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, iya garaafada billa yeddana” yaagis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa I giday Faasikka Baale wode issi asi enttaw billanayssi iyaw attonnabaa gidiya gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Derey ubbay issi bolla, “Ha uraa gede digga, nuus Barbbaana billa” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Barbbaani katamaa giddon asaa iitabaas denthethidi ase wodhdhidi qashettida asi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi Yesuusa billanaw koyidi asaas zaari odis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gidoshin, asay, “Kaqqa! Kaqqa!” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi heedzantho, “Ha uray qohidabay aybe? Wodhos gathiya bala ta demmabiikke. Hessa gisho, garaafada yedda aggana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Kaqettanaw bessees” gidi minthi waassidosona. Entta waasoykka xoonis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Entta oyshaa gisho, gidi Philaaxoosi iya bolla pirddis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asaa iitabaas denthetheyssanne ase wodhdhidi qashettidayssa bilettana mela woossida, he uraa enttaw billis. Shin Yesuusa entti koyidabaa oothana mela enttaw aathi immis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaqqidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Maato 27:31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusa oykkidi efishin Simoona giya Qerena biitta addey gaxareppe yishin, demmidi masqaliya toossidi Yesuusa kaallidi baana mela un77ethidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Daro asaynne bantta tiraa iccishe yeekkiya maccasati iya guyiyara kaalloosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi enttako guye simmidi, “Hinttenoo, Yerusalaame maccasato, hintte huu7esinne hintte naytas yeekkiteppe attin taw yeekkofite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>‘Hekko maynthati, yelonna ulotinne dhanthonna dhanthati anjjettidosona’ hintte yaagana gallasay yaana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He wode dereta, ‘Nu bolla kunddite’, zumatakka, ‘Nuna kammite’ yaagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hose 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Yo@Qo 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hiza, qaye mithaa hessatho oothiko mela mithaa waatanddeshsha?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Iyara wodhanaw hara nam77u worandzota efidosona <verse number="33" style="v"/>Qeeraniyo <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Qeeraniyo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qeeraniyo geyssi Girike doona. Aramayke doonan “Golggotta” woykko “Huu7e guugge” guussu. Qeeraniyo giya sunthay imettiday Yesuusi kaqettiday asa huu7e guugge daaniya bessan gidiya gishossa. He bessay Roome kawotethay worandzota kaqqiya bessi. (Maato 27: 33; Mar 15:22; Yoha 19:17)</char></note> geetettiya bessaa gathidi kaqqidosona. Worandzotappe issuwa ushachcha baggara hankkuwa haddirssa baggara kaqqidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ta aawaw, entti ay oothiyako eronna gisho, neeni enttaw atto yaaga” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz 22:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Entti iya afilaa bolla saama yeggidi shaakettidi ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Asay eqqidi xeellosona, shin deriya haareyssati, “Harata ashshis; Xoossay doorida Kiristtoosi iya gidikko ane bana ashsho” yaagidi leqisidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz 22:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti iyaakko shiiqidi, caala woyne ushshaa immidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yaatidi, “Neeni Ayhudeta kawo gidikko ne huu7iya ashsha” yaagidi leqisidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iyaw huu7e baggara, “Hayssi Ayhudeta kawo” yaagiya xuufey de7ees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kaqettida worandzotappe issoy cashshe sa7ara goochchishe, “Ane neeni Kiristtoosa gidikko, nenakka nunakka ashsha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin hankko worandzoy, “Neeni hayssa mela pirddan de7ashe hari attoshin, Xoossaas yayyikii? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nuuni nu balaas bessiya pirdda ekkoos, shin ha uray issi iitabaakka oothibeenna” yaagidi hanqettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Qassika, “Yesuusa, ne ne kawotethaara yaa wode tana qoppa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ta new tuma odays; hachchi neeni taara gannaten gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v"/>He gallas usuppun saateppe bidi uddufun saate gakkanaw away poo7uwa diggida gisho, biitta ubbaa bolla dhuma gidis. Xoossa Keetha magaraajjoy daakettidi nam77an shaakettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Kessa 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusi, qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Ta aawaw, ta ta shemppiw ne kushen sheedhdhays” yaagidi hayqqis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Maz 31:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mato halaqay, hanidayssa be7idi, “Hayssi uray tumakka xillo” yaagidi Xoossaa galatis. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ha haniyabaa be7anaw he bessaa shiiqida asay ubbay hanidabaa be7ida wode bantta tiraa iccishe bantta soo simmidosona. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Gidoshin, Yesuusa matan eriya asay ubbay, hessadakka Galiilappe kaallidi yida maccasati hessa be7ishe haahon eqqidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luuqa 8:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v"/>Ayhude shanggotappe issoy, Yoosefa geetettiya uray de7ees. I Armmatiyasa geetettiya Yihuda katamaappe yis. I lo77onne Xillo asi gidiya gisho Xoossaa kawotethaa yuussaa naagees. Shanggotappe issuwa gidishe entta zoretethaaninne oosuwan deenna. <verse number="52" style="v"/>He uray Philaaxoosakko bidi, Yesuusa ahaa mooganaw taw imma gidi woossis. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi ekka yaagin, Yesuusa ahaa wodhisidi afilara xaaxis. Zaallafe woocidi kessida hara asi moogettonna ooratha duufon wothis. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Sambbaati gelana haniya gisho, he gallasay giigetetha qamma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Galiilappe denddidi Yesuusa kaallidi yida maccasati Yoosefara bidi iya ahaa waati moogiyakko duufuwa akeekidi be7idosona. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Yaappe simmidi shittonne qibaatiya giigisidosona. Higgey kiitteyssa mela Sambbaata gallas shemppi pee7idosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kessa 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Zaare 5:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi hayqoppe denddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Maato 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Saaminttafe koyro gallas, wogga wode wontta daro guura, maccasati bantta giigisida shittuwa ekkidi duufuwa bidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti yaa gakkiya wode duufuwa doonan de7iya shuchchay gondderettidi kichchoyssa demmidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Entti duufuwa gaathi gelidosona, shin Godaa Yesuusa ahaa demmibookkona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti yan eqqidi aybi hanidee gidi qoppishin akeekonna daro phooliya afila ma77ida nam77u asati entta matan eqqidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Maccasati yashettidi bantta huu7iya sa7an ziqqi oothidi de7ishin, asati enttako, “De7on de7eyssa hayqota giddon ays koyeetii? <verse number="6-7" style="v"/>I hayssan deenna; hayqoppe denddis, ‘Asa Na7ay nagaranchchota kushen aadhdhi imettana; enttika iya kaqqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Maato 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luuqa 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char></note> I heedzantho qamman hayqoppe denddana’ yaagidi, I hinttera Galiilan de7ishe hinttew odida qaala qoppite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Maccasati he wode iya qaala qoppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Maccasati duufuwappe simmidi hanidabaa ubbaa tammanne issotasinne haratasikka odidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa hawaaretas odiday Magdela Mayraamo, Yohaanna, Yayqooba aayiw Mayraamonne enttara de7iya hara maccasata. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin enttaw maccasati odidayssi elmo daanin ammanibookkona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi denddi woxxidi duufo bis. He bessaa gakkidi hokki gaathi xeelliya wode moogo afilaa xalaala be7is. Hanidaban malaalettishe ba soo simmis.</para>
  <para style="s">Immahoose ogiya bolla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He gallas kaalliya tamaaretappe nam77ati Yerusalaameppe tammanne issi kilo mitire haakkiya Immahoose giya gutaa boosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Entti wolla hanidabaa ubbaa odettoosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Entti he hanotabaa qoppishenne odettishe biya wode Yesuusi ba huu7en shiiqidi enttara bees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hanoshin, entti iya eronna mela entta ayfey oykettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>I, “Hintte wolla oge bolla de7ishe odetteyssi aybe?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti azzanidi si7i gidi eqqidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Enttafe issoy Qeliyoophpha geetetteyssi, “Ha qammata giddon Yerusalaamen hanidabaa eronnayssi, ne biittaas imatheyye?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “I hanidayssi aybee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Xoossaa sinthaninne asa sinthan oosoninne odan mino nabe gidida Naazirete Yesuusabaa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iya kahinata halaqatinne nuna haareyssati hayqo pirddas aathi immidi, kaqqidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuuni Isra7eele asaa wozande gidi ufayttidi naagidashin hayssi hanin hachchi heedzantho qamma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qassi nu giddofe issi issi maccasati nuna malaalisidosona. Entti hachchi wontta guura duufuwa bidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iya ahaa dhayida wode simmi yidi, ‘I paxa de7ees’ yaagiya kiitanchchoti qonccin be7ida yaagidi odidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nu giddofekka issoti issoti duufuwa bidi maccasati odidayssatho hanin be7idosona, shin iya be7ibookkona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>I enttako, “Hinttenoo, akeekonna asato, hintte wozanay nabeti odidabaa ubbaa ammananaw gam77eyssato, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi ha metuwa ekkanawunne ba bonchchuwan gelanaw bessennee?” yaagis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Museppenne nabeta ubbaafe denddidi Geeshsha Maxaafan iyabay xaafettidayssa ubbaa enttaw qonccisis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Entti biya gutaakko matattida wode Yesuusi aadhdhidi haaho soo biya daanin, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entti, “Sa7ay qammida gisho nuura aqa” yaagidi minthidi woossidosona. Hessa gisho, enttara aqanaw gelis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Enttara issife gayta bolla uttidi, uythaa denthidi, meenthi anjjidi enttaw immis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>He wode entti erana mela entta ayfey dooyettis. Enttika eridosona. Shin I enttafe geemmis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Entti, “Nu ogiya bolla de7ishin I nuus Geeshsha Maxaafaa birshshishininne nuna haasayisishin nu wozanay xuugettibeenne?” yaagidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>He wode denddidi guye Yerusalaame yidosona. Tammanne issotinne harati issi bolla shiiqidi de7ishin demmidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Entti, “Goday tuma denddis; Simoonas qonccis” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>He nam77u tamaareti Immahoose ogiya bolla de7ishin hanidayssanne uythaa meenthida wode waati iya eridaakko enttaw odidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba tamaaretas qonccis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maato 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ha@O 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nam77u tamaareti hessa oda bolla de7ishin, Yesuusi entta giddon eqqidi, “Saroy hinttew gido” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Gidoshin, entti dagammidi, moytille be7ida daanin yayyidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>I enttako, “Ays babbidetii? Ays sidhey hintte wozanan gelidee? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ta kushiyanne ta tohuwa be7ite; taani tana. Qassi oykkidi be7ite; tanan hintte be7eyssada, moytilles ashoynne meqethi baawa” yaagis. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yaagidi, ba tohuwanne ba kushiya entta bessis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Entti ufayssafe denddoyssan ammanonna malaaletethan de7ishin, Yesuusi enttako, “Hayssan hinttew miyabay de7ii?” yaagis. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Enttika caacettida molo issuwa iyaw immidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>I ekkidi entta sinthan mis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>I, “Ta hinttera gam77ida wode ubban Muse maxaafatan, nabeta maxaafataninne Mazmure maxaafatan, ta gisho xaafettidabay ubbay polettanaw bessees yaagada ta hinttew odida qaalay hayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>He wode Geeshsha Maxaafata akeekana mela wozanaa entta dooyis. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hessadakka, “Kiristtoosi waaye ekkana, heedzantho qamman hayqoppe denddana yaagidi xaafettis. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yerusalaameppe denddidi asaa ubbaas nagaraappe maarotethaynne atotethay iya sunthan markkattana. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Hintte hessas markkatta. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Hekko, takka ta aaway immida ufayssaa hinttew yeddana. Hintte saloppe wolqqa ma77ana gakkanaw Yerusalaame kataman gam77ite” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Ha@O 1:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi denddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ha@O 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Bitaaniya geetettiya gutaa enttana ekkidi bis. Ba kushiya denthidi anjjis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50-51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ha@O 1:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="51" style="v"/>Enttana anjjishe enttafe shaakettidi pude salo ekettis. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Entti ziggi goynnidi daro ufayssan Yerusalaame simmidosona. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Xoossaa ubbaa wode galatishe Xoossa Keethan gam77idosona.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
